WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
– Tiffany Valentine was likely born sometime
in the late 1950s in New Jersey based on this line.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.599
– We’re from Jersey.

00:00:06.599 --> 00:00:08.210
– [Zac] …implying that both of them are.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.330
Tiffany is the older of two girls born in
her family.

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:13.540
Growing up, she was close to her mother who
had a lot of sayings about relationships that

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:17.430
stuck with her over the years, such as, “love
is supposed to set you free”, “if a woman

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:21.090
spends all day slaving over a hot stove for
a man, the least he can do is the dishes”,

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:24.609
“you can always smell it on girls who sell
it”, “you can’t put a price on love”,

00:00:24.609 --> 00:00:27.740
“never let a man c***block you from what
really makes you happy”, “if you love

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:31.380
somebody set them free” and perhaps the
one that would be most relevant to her: “once

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.289
is a blessing, twice is a curse.”

00:00:33.289 --> 00:00:35.630
– [Chucky] Well that would explain your
sister.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:39.540
– [Zac] Other than these quotes, Tiffany’s childhood
is, surprisingly, mostly never mentioned,

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.640
leaving the cause of her sadistic, homicidal
behavior up to speculation.

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:46.770
When you put all her mother’s quotes together,
you realize they are all kind-of salty takes

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:47.770
about relationships.

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:51.280
It makes me wonder if Tiffany’s mother left
her father and attempted to raise the girls

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:52.280
alone.

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:55.570
The Mrs. Valentinisms come up situationally
throughout the franchise, but let’s try

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.460
putting them in the correct order and building
Tiffany’s story.

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.379
“Once is a blessing, twice is a curse.”

00:01:00.379 --> 00:01:03.719
Tiffany’s parents started off well, but
things declined when her younger sister was

00:01:03.719 --> 00:01:06.100
born, because caring for a second child was
more stressful.

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:07.830
“The least he can do is the dishes.”

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:11.240
Tiffany’s mom becomes fed up with her father
not pulling his weight in household chores.

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:15.000
“You can always smell it on girls who sell
it” and “you can’t put a price on love”.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.180
Sounds like as their relationship deteriorated,
Mr. Valentine turned to a pr*stitute.

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.689
“Never let a man c***block you from what
really makes you happy” and “if you love

00:01:22.689 --> 00:01:23.979
somebody set them free.”

00:01:23.979 --> 00:01:27.049
She finally snaps, and gets divorced from
Tiffany’s father.

00:01:27.049 --> 00:01:30.620
My guess is that it was quite a dramatic falling
out, which will help to explain almost all

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:32.939
of Tiffany’s puzzling behavior later on.

00:01:32.939 --> 00:01:35.740
As far we can tell, she has never had any
platonic friends.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:39.899
She’s hanging out alone at a nightclub in
1984, sipping a martini when she’s first

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.640
approached by a man who calls her Red.

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:43.070
He’s referring to her red hair.

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:46.590
It’s not clear if this is her natural hair
color, but red is her favorite color.

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:49.619
– Is there something I can do for you?

00:01:49.619 --> 00:01:51.139
– Yeah, maybe there is.

00:01:51.139 --> 00:01:54.670
– [Zac] They all end up at the Hotel Hackensack,
where Tiffany and the blonde get busy while

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:55.729
the man watches.

00:01:55.729 --> 00:01:58.690
She demonstrates her aggressive behavior by
ripping off the woman’s necklace.

00:01:58.690 --> 00:02:02.430
While she’s distracted, the man yanks her
off of the bed and gestures a knife in her

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:03.430
direction.

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.749
Instead of cowering away, she just just smiles
and eggs him on.

00:02:05.749 --> 00:02:06.749
– Do it.

00:02:06.749 --> 00:02:09.989
Do it to me now.

00:02:09.989 --> 00:02:13.069
– Her aggressiveness with the woman and
masochism with the man is enough to make me

00:02:13.069 --> 00:02:16.690
think that Tiffany had already discovered
her bloodlust prior to meeting this couple,

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:19.510
and she was probably at that nightclub looking
for prey.

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:23.430
She was wearing a leopard pattern afterall,
she’s identifying herself as a predator.

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:26.590
The man locks eyes with her for a minute,
and the blonde gets jealous.

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:30.330
In an unexpected move, he stabs the blonde
instead of the redhead, and invites Tiffany

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:31.959
to play in the carnage with him.

00:02:31.959 --> 00:02:35.720
She proceeds to stab the woman seven more
times as she breaks down into cries of joy

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:36.720
and laughter.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:40.530
– Wow, it’s never happened like that before.

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:43.700
– She doesn't specify exactly what she’s
talking about here, but it does further my

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:46.970
suspicion that this isn’t the first chapter
of her crime career.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:49.790
The two passionately make love beside the
mess they just created.

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:53.510
She introduces herself, and when she learns
his name, Charles, she is the one to suggest

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:54.680
that he go by Chucky.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:56.849
He gives her a suggestion as well: to go blonde.

00:02:56.849 --> 00:03:00.450
These suggestions each became iconic elements
of their respective characters.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:05.069
And so began one of the worst, most toxic
romances I’ve ever ****ing seen.

00:03:05.069 --> 00:03:09.110
To learn how Tiffany’s childhood shaped
her into a monster, the secrets behind her

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:12.780
survival, the disturbing truth about her motherhood
and how her career as a professional poker

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:16.890
player helped her carry out an evil plot in
the future, stick around to the end of this

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:17.390
video.

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:21.990
♪ Metal Music ♪

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:25.310
Welcome to Horror History.

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:28.850
There are not many characters who have the
power to revitalize a franchise so many years

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:29.850
in.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:34.240
After Child’s Play 3 in 1991, producers
Don Mancini and David Kirschner were inspired

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:37.900
to try a fresh take for Chucky after seeing
the way Scream reinvigorated the horror genre

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:41.470
with satire, something they talked about on
the movie’s official website back in the

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:43.659
days when movie websites didn’t suck.

00:03:43.659 --> 00:03:47.599
The fourth Chucky film became more of a romantic
comedy by introducing a love interest for

00:03:47.599 --> 00:03:49.300
the supernaturally possessed doll.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:52.940
Enter Tiffany Valentine, or as she would become
known, Tiffany Ray.

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:56.260
Tiffany is a name of Greek origin, meaning
“Manifestation of God”.

00:03:56.260 --> 00:04:00.970
She would be the second character ever to
be aided by the power of the Voodoo God Damballa.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:04.180
Valentine refers to the holiday of love and
romance, Valentine’s Day.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:07.680
Tiffany’s entire character has been influenced
by her mother’s distorted teachings about

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.680
love.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.980
Although the fanbase is split on the comedic
approach to Chucky, which I refer to as the

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:16.009
Bride-Seed arc, most would agree that Tiffany
has become a fan favorite character who stuck

00:04:16.009 --> 00:04:19.410
around even after the movies swung back to
a horror first approach.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:22.740
From an emotional standpoint, there is a lot
going on with this character, so let's take

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:26.121
it back to her mid 20s to understand how she
got so messed up.

00:04:26.121 --> 00:04:29.852
♪ Mysterious Music ♪

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:34.100
Tiffany is referred to as a body disposal
expert.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:37.389
It’s clear that she has no sense of morality,
but her skill when it comes to cleaning up

00:04:37.389 --> 00:04:41.050
after herself at least keeps her from facing
any murder charges in her 20s.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:44.680
That being said, her disregard for other laws
still got her in trouble, often landing her

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:49.040
with jail time and mugshot in the newspaper.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:54.400
– I always dreamed of having a big church
wedding with bridesmaids and a cake and my

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:59.490
picture in the paper -- not just my usual
mugshot but something really flattering.

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:02.790
– At some point, authorities distinguished
her from being a common criminal and determined

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.490
that mental illness was a factor.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.100
– Is Mommy ill?

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.800
– The courts thought so…

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:10.060
– She’s somehow able to stay out of an
institution.

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:14.010
I would conclude her life of crime linked
to mental illness was a direct result of her

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:15.010
upbringing.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:18.180
Her mother’s philosophies make it clear
that there was a lot of friction between Tiffany’s

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.180
parents.

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:22.419
This medically reviewed article by Clinical
Social Worker Amy Morin describes the mental

00:05:22.419 --> 00:05:24.590
effects that fighting parents can have on
a child.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:28.759
A lot of these describe Tiffany’s behavior,
but for now, let’s look at Behavior Problems.

00:05:28.759 --> 00:05:32.949
“Parental conflict has been linked to increased
aggression, delinquency, and conduct problems

00:05:32.949 --> 00:05:33.949
in children.”

00:05:33.949 --> 00:05:37.800
As these kids develop into adults, behavior
problems in school become run-ins with the

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:41.080
law, inability to fit in in society, and mugshots
in the paper.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:44.900
Shortly after she hooked up with Chucky, Chucky
actually killed Tiffany’s mother.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.900
The woman that Tiff is constantly quoting.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:50.659
Yet, she stays with Chucky after this, and
even wants to spend more time with him.

00:05:50.659 --> 00:05:56.120
– [Tiffany] I mean, I always wanted us to
spend more time together, maybe do some traveling

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:58.530
and see the world.

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:01.870
– This suggests that in her adulthood, she
didn’t have a good relationship with her

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:04.669
mother, which could likely be a lingering
effect of parental fighting.

00:06:04.669 --> 00:06:06.770
“It can affect the parent-child relationship…

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:10.210
the quality of the relationship may be affected
as it may be difficult for parents to show

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:13.210
warmth and affection when they’re angry
and upset with the other parent.”

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:17.270
I can basically go on and on about how parental
quarrels may have impacted her.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.460
For example, it can cause insecurity.

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:22.990
Tiffany gets a tattoo on her chest, a heart
with a dagger and her boyfriend’s name.

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:26.760
This study in the National Library of Medicine
found that young women with tattoos reported

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:28.430
significantly lower self esteem.

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:32.550
I’m not saying all tattoos bad -- I have
a tattoo -- but the difference is mine is

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:34.699
perfect, and I had a long time to think about
it.

00:06:34.699 --> 00:06:38.150
Tiffany’s is a tacky emotional crutch she
got to impress a man who doesn’t actually

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:39.289
care about her.

00:06:39.289 --> 00:06:41.550
Tiffany also becomes a big fan of Martha Stewart.

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:44.699
The article states that women who watch Martha
Stewart have significantly…

00:06:44.699 --> 00:06:45.699
I’m kidding.

00:06:45.699 --> 00:06:48.729
After a few years of dating and committing
crimes together in Hackensack it was time

00:06:48.729 --> 00:06:52.870
for these two fish to move to a bigger pond
-- or should I say lake?

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:55.890
But first there was one order of business
to take care of.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:59.612
(Impact)

00:07:00.968 --> 00:07:04.913
♪ Mysterious music ♪

00:07:04.913 --> 00:07:09.819
Before leaving New Jersey, Chucky and Tiffany
need a vehicle, and the two look at this 1960

00:07:09.819 --> 00:07:11.050
Pontiac Perisian.

00:07:11.050 --> 00:07:14.259
Tiffany loves the color, Coronado red, because
it’s her favorite color and it can easily

00:07:14.259 --> 00:07:15.520
hide splatters of blood.

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:18.840
When the seller discloses that the previous
owners were decapitated in the car, she gets

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:19.979
a huge smile.

00:07:19.979 --> 00:07:23.784
She gleefully slashes the seller’s throat
with her nail file and climbs into the driver’s seat.

00:07:23.784 --> 00:07:26.120
She also takes a little taste of her blood.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:29.819
Along with weaponizing her nail file, this
is something that becomes a signature of hers.

00:07:29.819 --> 00:07:33.229
As they set off she notices Chucky reading
something about Voodoo, something that would

00:07:33.229 --> 00:07:35.180
become a very big part of her life later on.

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:39.110
They arrive in Chicago, Illinois in 1988 and
get their first apartment together.

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:43.250
She’s immediately blown away by it and begins
interior designing in her head -- Martha Stewart

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:44.610
has been rubbing off on her.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:48.050
Charles suggests they order a pizza, and she
loves the idea, because she knows exactly

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:49.050
what that means.

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:53.120
Not only are they ordering a pizza, but they’re
also ordering a pizza delivery man, and new

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:56.229
victims are just as satiating as deep dish
for these two.

00:07:56.229 --> 00:07:59.919
They share a cigarette afterwards as they
debate the merits of Chicago vs Jersey style

00:07:59.919 --> 00:08:00.919
pizza.

00:08:00.919 --> 00:08:04.550
This scene also contains more potential evidence
that disaccord from her youth is still affecting her.

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:08.670
Another telltale sign is substance abuse,
something that becomes much more likely in

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:10.110
a high-conflict family.

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:13.009
But at least at this point, the young couple
is getting along.

00:08:13.009 --> 00:08:16.620
Like substance abuse, violence seems to be
something that can numb over any relationship

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:17.620
issues.

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:21.009
I think a lot of people have had that ex that
isn’t really compatible with you, but when

00:08:21.009 --> 00:08:22.460
you’re in bed everything is good.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:24.180
For these two, it’s offing people.

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:28.150
And like that ex, there are a limited amount
of times you turn to this distraction before

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.699
the relationship issues are impossible to
ignore.

00:08:30.699 --> 00:08:33.760
As they stop hunting together as frequently,
tension rises in their relationship.

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:37.620
At the time of the original movie, Chucky
has his own place, so my theory is that they

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:41.110
broke up, causing him to move out, but they
got back together, and Chucky just kept his

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:43.060
other apartment to use for other purposes.

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:46.540
Besides, he’s definitely not getting his
deposit back seeing as what he’s done with

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:47.540
the place.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:50.860
Chucky starts seeing another woman at this
point, however, it’s not clear if Tiffany

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:51.860
knew about this.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:54.339
I don’t think she did, but I’ll get to
that later.

00:08:54.339 --> 00:08:58.010
On November 8th, 1988, Tiffany comes home
from the grocery store with ingredients to

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:01.730
make Chucky’s favorite food: Swedish meatballs,
and catches him in the other room finishing

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:02.730
some lady with his knife.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:05.500
That’s not an innuendo, I mean that literally.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:09.149
But to her, stabbing solo is just as bad as
cheating; she’s jealous that he’s getting

00:09:09.149 --> 00:09:10.279
his fix without her.

00:09:10.279 --> 00:09:13.209
A sort of new form of JGS that we’ve never
explored before.

00:09:13.209 --> 00:09:17.050
She confronts him on their lack of murder
dates as of late, but he just blows off the argument.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:20.340
It’s obvious that this isn’t the first
time they’ve separated without being able

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:21.340
to talk out the problem.

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:25.350
It’s a symptom of one of the biggest effects
of parental in-fighting: relationship issues.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:26.940
It’s pretty obvious how this goes.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:30.210
As a kid, your brain is still developing and
adapting to your environment.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:33.519
When kids see their parents fighting all the
time, they learn that that’s how you solve

00:09:33.519 --> 00:09:37.529
disputes, and they end up using the same tactics
in their personal relationships, which means:

00:09:37.529 --> 00:09:39.019
toxic relationships.

00:09:39.019 --> 00:09:41.959
Instead of trying to fix the issue, she tries
to get back at her boyfriend.

00:09:41.959 --> 00:09:45.400
She calls the police station and asks for
Detective Mike Norris, the lead detective

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:48.760
on the Lakeshore Strangler case, and fills
him in on Charles’s whereabouts.

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:52.040
This leads to the police finding where he’s
kidnapped his mistress, chasing him through

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:55.220
Chicago, and ultimately killing him inside
a toy store.

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:58.720
After his death, Tiffany finds a ring on the
mantle, and believes Chucky had been planning

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.019
to propose to her.

00:10:00.019 --> 00:10:03.579
Tiffany does know that Charles had been experimenting
with Voodoo, and keeps hope alive that he

00:10:03.579 --> 00:10:07.150
might have been able to transfer his soul
out of his body before dying, so she continues

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:08.700
to wear the ring every day.

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:10.550
She searched for 10 years.

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:14.620
There are rumors and urban legends of a possessed
Good Guy doll that first appeared right after

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:18.960
Charles’s death in 1988, then again in 1990,
but the alleged activity always dissipates

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:20.380
before Tiffany can get there.

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:22.930
She’s forced to move to a mobile home in
Lockport, New York.

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:27.459
I’m guessing she moved there in 1998 or
1999 because at the time of Bride of Chucky

00:10:27.459 --> 00:10:30.550
in Spring 1999, it sounds like she hasn’t
been around for long.

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:32.910
– You moving out already?

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:35.270
– [Zac] She keeps the ring and the car, but nothing
else.

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:39.279
Her belief in Chucky’s return is so strong
that she fantasizes about having a baby with

00:10:39.279 --> 00:10:42.540
him when he comes back and builds a slide
out playpen in her trailer.

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:44.839
The place is decorated all over with baby
dolls.

00:10:44.839 --> 00:10:47.950
It’s possible that she just has an obsession
with dolls because of the legends about her

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:51.450
boyfriend becoming a doll, but based on her
past, I have a different theory.

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:54.899
I talked about the emotional damage she received
from her parents fighting with each other,

00:10:54.899 --> 00:10:58.959
but perhaps the stressful home environment
also led to one of the parents abusing her.

00:10:58.959 --> 00:11:01.320
These victims tend to have their emotional
development stunted.

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:04.950
In other words, the trauma may freeze their
brain’s development, making them unable

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:06.510
to grow up in certain ways.

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:10.180
This could explain the baby dolls, the “little
girl” voice associated with many of these

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:11.220
types of victims…

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:12.220
– Awake!

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:13.220
Awake!

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:14.620
Awake, awake, awake!

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:18.660
– …childlike tantrums, and many other
symptoms, some of which overlap with psychological

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:20.610
damage caused by fighting between parents.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:24.320
I’m not gonna dwell on this too much, because
there’s no evidence that she was abused…

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:27.670
it’s possible that she just likes dolls…
but I wouldn’t be surprised if we end up

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:30.450
learning her parents were a little heavy handed
with her.

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:33.510
It seems like she’s about to move on from
Chucky by 1999.

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:37.200
She starts dating a cringy goth dude named
Damian, but doesn’t put out for him, because

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:38.200
in her words:

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:42.279
– I’ll kill anyone, but I’ll only sleep
with someone I love.

00:11:42.279 --> 00:11:45.399
– And she doesn’t love him because he’s
not a real killer like Chucky.

00:11:45.399 --> 00:11:49.230
In 1999, she hears about another potential
Chucky appearance at a military academy in

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:50.230
Missouri.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:53.260
The remains of the Good Guy doll end up in
an evidence locker nearby, so she bribes a

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:56.860
cop named Robert Bailey to retrieve them for
her, only to slit his throat with her nail

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:58.570
file and collect the spoils.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:01.660
She goes home to sew the doll back together
and attempts to bring it to life with the

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:03.380
help of her Voodoo For Dummies book.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:07.470
It doesn’t appear to work at first, however,
Damian comes over and she soon notices that

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:08.700
the doll has moved.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:12.750
She gets the idea to chain Damian to the bed
and strip-tease for both him and the doll.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:18.130
– If anyone even looked at me, Chucky would
take care of him.

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.470
Wouldn’t you Chucky?

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:20.750
– This is her cue.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:24.730
Chucky turns his head to lock eyes with Damian
and Tiffany looks on as her ex rips out her

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:27.339
new boyfriend’s piercing and smothers him
with a pillow.

00:12:27.339 --> 00:12:30.600
Bringing someone to an early grave is what
started Tiffany and Chucky’s relationship,

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:33.750
and it also provides the spark for them to
rekindle that relationship here.

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:36.529
The couple are actually glad to see each other
for a couple of minutes before they go back

00:12:36.529 --> 00:12:40.610
to being toxic as ****. It’s part of a long
cycle, which we will see more examples of.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:43.980
It doesn’t take long for the friction between
them to start up again when Chucky makes an

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.290
off putting comment.

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:48.639
– I always thought you were gonna let yourself
go.

00:12:48.639 --> 00:12:52.060
– Nonetheless, she prepares him his favorite
meal, Swedish Meatballs, and explains how

00:12:52.060 --> 00:12:53.639
she never stopped wearing his ring.

00:12:53.639 --> 00:12:57.519
She is dismayed to find out that Charles had
stolen the ring in order to sell it, not to

00:12:57.519 --> 00:12:58.519
propose to her.

00:12:58.519 --> 00:13:02.510
When he hysterically laughs in his face, she
realizes that he hasn’t changed and probably

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:03.510
never will.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:07.100
She locks him in her makeshift playpen, and
tells him she prefers him in this baby-like

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:08.100
form.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:11.020
I think what she really likes is having control
over him, since his independent behavior is

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:12.810
what caused issues for them in the past.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:16.019
The bedroom is one thing, but hopefully I
don’t have to explain why it’s not a good

00:13:16.019 --> 00:13:20.079
idea to get involved with a woman who is a
control freak in ALL aspects of life.

00:13:20.079 --> 00:13:23.639
This is another aspect of her character that
stays with her through the years.

00:13:23.639 --> 00:13:27.670
That night she removes her ring for the first
time and weeps in her bed next to Damian’s

00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:28.670
lifeless body.

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:32.580
The next day, she would look for love elsewhere,
but her search, and her life… would be cut

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:33.493
short.

00:13:33.493 --> 00:13:36.823
(impact)

00:13:38.397 --> 00:13:42.217
♪ mysterious music ♪

00:13:42.217 --> 00:13:46.519
The next day, Tiffany gets her neighbor, Jesse
Miller, to help her load the trunk containing

00:13:46.519 --> 00:13:47.760
Damain’s body into the car.

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:51.720
She asks Jesse out on a date evening, but
Jesse has a girlfriend, so Tiffany tells him

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:55.149
to treat her right, and heads off to dump
Damian in the East River, which according

00:13:55.149 --> 00:13:59.149
to Buffalo native and fellow YouTube creator
Bryce Edward Brown, is the prime location

00:13:59.149 --> 00:14:02.320
to dump bodies in New York… not sure why
he knows that.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:05.980
On the way back, she buys a female doll, about
Chucky’s size, and puts it into the playpen

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:08.259
with him to be his new partner to taunt him.

00:14:08.259 --> 00:14:11.509
That evening she takes a bath and giggles
as she watches the news report on her most

00:14:11.509 --> 00:14:15.110
recent string of victims before switching
to Bride of Frankenstein, which she seems

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:19.452
moved by, perhaps because of the monster’s
unconditional interest in the Bride upon their meeting. 

00:14:19.452 --> 00:14:23.660
While Tiffany is distracted, Chucky escapes
his cage and pushes her TV into the bath,

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:25.540
causing her to be electrocuted to death.

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:28.600
This is where most people do that joke where
the video is over, but I’m kinda sick of

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:32.160
that meme, so let’s just skip to the part
where Chucky transfers her soul into the female

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:35.339
doll and she wakes up, realizes what happened,
and is horrified.

00:14:35.339 --> 00:14:39.300
With both of them in doll form, Chucky wants
to marry her so that she can love, serve,

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:40.300
and obey him.

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:43.389
Hopefully I don’t have to explain why it’s
not a good idea to get involved with someone

00:14:43.389 --> 00:14:44.910
with those intentions.

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:48.360
Tiffany is more interested in transferring
back into a human body, but Chuck explains

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:51.930
to do that they will need an amulet called
The Heart of Damballa, which was buried with

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:53.330
Chucky’s human corpse in Hackensack, NJ.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:57.610
They come up with a plan to get Jesse to drive
them to the cemetery in Hackensack for $1000

00:14:57.610 --> 00:15:00.389
under the ruse that Tiffany can’t deliver
the dolls herself because she’s taking care

00:15:00.389 --> 00:15:02.518
of a friend who is mentally incapacitated.

00:15:02.518 --> 00:15:04.057
(slurping sound)

00:15:04.057 --> 00:15:08.110
Before leaving, she gives herself a makeover
to look more like her human self, which I

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:11.600
don’t get because she’s planning to go
back to a human form in just a couple days.

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:12.600
– Women.

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:15.860
– Next, there’s a scene that isn’t shown
in any movie, but is kind of important to

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:16.889
talk about.

00:15:16.889 --> 00:15:20.610
Chucky and Tiffany hide Tiffany’s discarded
human body somewhere, so that Jesse doesn’t

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:22.709
come into the trailer and discover it rotting
there.

00:15:22.709 --> 00:15:25.990
This works to their advantage much later on,
but we’ll get to that.

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:29.460
After finding Tiffany’s note, Jesse makes
an unexpected stop to pick up his girlfriend,

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:33.530
Jade, with plans to run away and get married,
which Tiffany finds romantic, but Chucky finds

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:34.530
sickening.

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:35.980
– That’s so romantic!

00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:39.610
– I’d give ‘em six months.

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:40.899
Three if she gains weight.

00:15:40.899 --> 00:15:44.839
– [Zac] They watch as Jade’s uncle, the Lockport
police chief Warren Kincaid, tries to plant

00:15:44.839 --> 00:15:48.959
drugs in Jesse’s van, so Tiffany creates
a trap using nails and an airbag, designed

00:15:48.959 --> 00:15:51.769
to kill Warren when he goes to investigate
her giggling in the front seat.

00:15:51.769 --> 00:15:54.399
They hide the chief under the back seat before
Jesse and Jade get back.

00:15:54.399 --> 00:15:58.279
They must be able to hoist him up there due
to the super strength afforded by Damballa.

00:15:58.279 --> 00:16:01.930
When Jesse and Jade come back, they stay in
“barbie mode” around humans to try to

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:04.029
get to their destination without raising suspicion.

00:16:04.029 --> 00:16:08.520
The van immediately gets pulled over by another
cop, the chief’s lackey, Officer Norton.

00:16:08.520 --> 00:16:11.730
As he searches the vehicle, Tiffany kicks
him in the head to prevent him from finding

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:15.240
Warren’s body, but as a result, he does
find the drugs that were planted there.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:18.949
Wanting to keep their journey on track, and
their chauffeur out of prison, Chucky borrows

00:16:18.949 --> 00:16:23.430
Tiff’s lighter, and she watches with delight
as he uses it to ignite Officer Norton’s

00:16:23.430 --> 00:16:25.370
gas tank.

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:27.309
(scream, explosion)

00:16:27.309 --> 00:16:30.759
Jesse speeds away from the scene, which Tiffany
refers to as Chucky “still knowing how to

00:16:30.759 --> 00:16:32.319
show a girl a good time.”

00:16:32.319 --> 00:16:35.980
Once again, all logic about the compatibility
of their relationship goes out the window

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:38.529
for her when she sees Chucky do what he does
best.

00:16:38.529 --> 00:16:42.209
The two dolls giggle as Jesse and Jade bicker
about what just actually happened.

00:16:42.209 --> 00:16:46.300
They stop at a small chapel in Niagara Falls
to tie the knot, and Tiffany shares her longtime

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:50.795
dream of getting married, which actually causes
Chucky to stop and actually give her a real apology.

00:16:50.795 --> 00:16:54.360
I guess being back on the run from the law
with her reminded him of their younger days

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:55.829
and struck a chord with him.

00:16:55.829 --> 00:16:58.560
Every time blood spills, they seem to get
a little bit closer.

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:03.019
To add to the romance, Warren, who is somehow
still alive, pops up in the back of the van

00:17:03.019 --> 00:17:05.280
and Chucky stabs him in the back to finish
the job.

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:09.120
That night, they all stay at the Honeymoon
Sweets motel in Niagara where another couple

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:13.329
barges into Jesse and Jade’s room, and Tiffany
notices the woman steals Jesse’s wallet.

00:17:13.329 --> 00:17:16.650
Obviously this woman doesn’t know that the
dolls are alive, so Tiffany ends up being

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:19.350
the only one to see this happen, and it enrages
her.

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:23.030
I’m guessing Tiffany is not suddenly taking
some kind of moral high ground, and this is

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:26.209
more about trying to ensure that their journey
is not interrupted again.

00:17:26.209 --> 00:17:29.820
She sneaks into their room and hurls their
champagne bottle at the mirror on the ceiling,

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:33.450
causing it to shatter and slice them apart
on the way down; the first example of Tiffany’s

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:34.880
very impressive throwing arm.

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:37.490
Chucky is absolutely smitten after seeing
this.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:38.980
– I love you.

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:42.950
– He steals the ring finger of the newly
deceased newlywed and uses it to propose to

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:45.610
Tiffany for real this time, and she’s brought
to tears.

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:47.750
From this point, she goes by Tiffany Ray.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:52.380
After realizing she has one human bodily function,
her tears, two two decide to test another.

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:55.679
Chucky believes that he doesn’t need to
use a rubber because he’s ALL rubber…

00:17:55.679 --> 00:17:57.260
despite actually being made of plastic…

00:17:57.260 --> 00:17:59.980
so the two brush it off and continue their
intimate moment.

00:17:59.980 --> 00:18:02.470
This moment would have dire consequences.

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:05.559
Tiffany becomes pregnant, and because the
two dolls are being kept alive by the power

00:18:05.559 --> 00:18:09.870
of Voodoo, this is a Voodoo pregnancy, which
means everything is accelerated and only takes

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:11.750
a couple days until delivery.

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:14.760
Despite that, they don’t realize they’ve
just conceived a child.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:18.020
Later that night, they come up with a plan
to transfer their souls into Jesse and Jade’s

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:19.830
bodies once they’ve re-acquired the amulet.

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:23.030
The next morning, they have to make a quick
exit when the maid discovers the bodies of

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:26.260
the other hooneymooning couple, and Jesse
and Jade are surprised by the appearance of

00:18:26.260 --> 00:18:29.539
their friend David, who shows up to help out
with the newfound relationship issues being

00:18:29.539 --> 00:18:31.720
caused by the murderous dolls that they’re
towing.

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:35.600
When David accidentally finds Warren’s decomposing
remains in the back, he grabs the chief’s

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:40.419
gun and demands they pull over, just as a
passing cop recognizes Jesse’s van and approaches.

00:18:40.419 --> 00:18:44.120
The change in circumstances forces Chucky
and Tiffany to make themselves known by pulling

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:48.210
out guns of their own… which I have no idea
how they obtained… and take the three humans

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:49.210
hostage.

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:52.530
This frightens David, so much that he backs
himself into oncoming traffic, so Tiffany

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:53.660
gives Jesse the order to

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:55.879
– Get this heap of **** moving!

00:18:55.879 --> 00:18:59.200
– After getting away, they steal an RV from
an older couple by shooting them in the head

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.290
so they won’t be recognized on the road.

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:05.230
Tiffany ties up Jade and gives her a makeover,
presumably preparing for the moment she “moves

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:06.480
in” to Jade’s body.

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:10.090
She also makes some meatballs and cookies
in the oven for her new husband, but quickly

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:13.590
becomes enraged when Chucky makes a comment
about the dishes not being cleaned.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:17.020
Jade and Jesse make a couple strategic remarks
to kind of turn Tiffany and Chucky against

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:18.020
each other.

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:22.160
Jade edges Tiffany to retaliate after feeling
unappreciated, and this starts a huge fight,

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:25.179
which includes dish throwing, bickering, and
insulting Chucky’s manhood.

00:19:25.179 --> 00:19:31.230
– Take it from me honey, plastic is no substitute
for a nice hunk of wood.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:35.280
– Jade uses the distraction to kick Tiffany
into the oven, and the RV crashes in the ensuing

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:38.120
chaos, conveniently right into the cemetery
where they need to go.

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:41.700
Tiffany’s skin bakes inside of the oven,
increasing her rage even further.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:45.460
She busts out and attacks Jade, biting her
in the ear, before Jesse grabs her and throws

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:46.460
her out the window.

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:50.470
She’s unable to get to her gun before Jesse,
and he takes her as a hostage to counter Chucky,

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:52.100
who is holding Jade at gunpoint.

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:55.510
They come to the grave plot of Charles Lee
Ray, where the exhumation is currently in

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:56.510
progress.

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:59.179
When Jesse and Tiffany get there, Chucky has
recovered the amulet.

00:19:59.179 --> 00:20:03.240
The two make an exchange: Jade will go back
to Jesse in exchange for Chucky getting Tiffany

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:06.630
back, but something is different about her
demeanor this time, she’s really had it

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:07.630
with Chucky.

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:10.100
We see the difference in how Jesse and Chucky
treat their women.

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:13.919
Jade falls into Jesse’s arms, but Chucky
lets Tiffany fall to the ground.

00:20:13.919 --> 00:20:17.840
This allows Tiffany to see how she wants to
be treated vs. how she’s actually treated

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:21.027
in real time, and for her, this is the final
straw.

00:20:21.027 --> 00:20:25.184
– Endonline pour de boisette damballa!

00:20:25.184 --> 00:20:29.167
Endelieu pour de boisette damballa!!!

00:20:29.167 --> 00:20:30.657
(impact)

00:20:34.174 --> 00:20:38.380
♪ melancholic music ♪

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:41.750
– Jesse and Jade find themselves tied up
by Chucky, who attempts to perform the Damballa

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:43.740
chant to possess their bodies.

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:47.340
Before completing the ritual, Tiffany tells
Chucky that she loves him and that they belong

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:50.840
together forever, but while kissing him, she
steals his knife and uses it to stab him in

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:54.940
the back before clarifying: they do belong
together, they belong together in hell.

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:58.380
The two fight, and Chucky stabs her in the
chest, but she at least creates enough of

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:02.310
a distraction for Jesse to knock Chuck down
into the open grave, where he’s ultimately

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:03.650
killed once more.

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:07.370
After the dust settled, the lead detective
on the Jesse and Jade case discovered Tiffany’s

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:10.929
charred remains, and she springs to life with
the very last of her energy to give birth

00:21:10.929 --> 00:21:15.050
to a child before she gives out; in a way,
fulfilling her mother’s prophecy that love

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:16.050
would set her free.

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:19.990
It’s not known exactly how, but Chucky and
Tiffany’s doll bodies end up in the hands

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:22.820
of a movie studio, rather than in another
evidence locker.

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:25.070
Tiffany’s human body is still never discovered.

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:28.920
She remains dead for another 5 years, until
March 18th 2004.

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:32.730
The dolls have been adapted into animatronics,
which are being used to shoot a movie called

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:36.330
Chucky Goes Psycho, in which Tiffany helps
Chucky defeat a man pretending to be Santa

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:37.330
Claus.

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:40.270
During a break, they are sitting in a prop
room when their child, who has since been

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:44.159
given the name Sh*tface, finally tracks them
down and reads the inscription found on the

00:21:44.159 --> 00:21:47.950
back of the Heart of Damballa, which brings
both Chucky and Tiffany to life with a jolt

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:48.950
of electricity.

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:52.429
Tiffany’s motherly instincts immediately
kick in, and she asks where his parents are

00:21:52.429 --> 00:21:54.660
before realizing who he really is.

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:58.480
As the two embrace, she calls him Sweetface,
the same name she had given to Jesse when

00:21:58.480 --> 00:21:59.710
she was hitting on him.

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:03.400
Maybe this is not that big of a deal, but
I do find it a little off-putting that she

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:08.250
time and time again shows no separation between
romantic love and motherly love.

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:13.360
We see it again much later, when she reunites
with doll Chucky, aka, her husband, and treats

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:17.419
him like a little baby, but we’ve got a
lot to cover before we can even begin to unpack

00:22:17.419 --> 00:22:18.419
that.

00:22:18.419 --> 00:22:21.380
And I’m not saying it’s weird for couples
to use pet names, a lot of people do that…

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:24.860
although it is CRINGE… but it’s more the
way that Tiffany does it in addition to her

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:29.700
other pre-existing derangements that makes
me feel this is just another example of Tiffany’s

00:22:29.700 --> 00:22:31.150
poorly adjusted behavior.

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:34.370
Before Sweetface can finish filling them in
on where they are, the animatronic effects

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:38.049
artist comes in and goes to work on Tiffany,
but gets a shock upon opening her up to find

00:22:38.049 --> 00:22:39.539
real human organs.

00:22:39.539 --> 00:22:42.860
Chucky tosses a length of string around the
man’s neck and Tiffany helps do the honors

00:22:42.860 --> 00:22:44.570
of decapitating him with it.

00:22:44.570 --> 00:22:48.799
Once again, this act overwhelms the two of
them with passion, and all past drama is forgotten

00:22:48.799 --> 00:22:53.179
as they share a kiss… which is interrupted
by the sound of their kid, pissing his or

00:22:53.179 --> 00:22:54.179
her pants.

00:22:54.179 --> 00:22:57.880
Come to think of it, they never did get around
to the whole gender reveal party, considering

00:22:57.880 --> 00:23:01.659
they were both killed right as he was born,
so when they go to check things out for themselves,

00:23:01.659 --> 00:23:05.260
the kid has no genitals, just what you would
expect from a children’s doll.

00:23:05.260 --> 00:23:08.340
Tiffany wants her child to be a girl, while
Chucky wants a son.

00:23:08.340 --> 00:23:10.890
Chucky names the kid Glen, and Tiffany goes
with Glenda.

00:23:10.890 --> 00:23:14.299
The nomenclature was inspired by the 1953
drama film, Glen or Glenda.

00:23:14.299 --> 00:23:16.800
I’m just gonna go with Glen for now to make
things easier.

00:23:16.800 --> 00:23:19.970
This gender disagreement would be the source
of a lot of confusion for the child later

00:23:19.970 --> 00:23:24.299
on, but before arguing any further, they’re
interrupted by Hollywood actress Jennifer

00:23:24.299 --> 00:23:27.400
Tilly, who is using the room as a secret snacking
location.

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:31.400
Tiffany is starstruck upon seeing her idol,
perhaps Ms. Tilly was an inspiration to her

00:23:31.400 --> 00:23:35.140
because she looks and sounds just like Tiffany
did when she had a human body.

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:38.610
Jennifer Tilly soon after realizes that the
decapitated head on the ground is no movie

00:23:38.610 --> 00:23:42.000
prop, and the movie shuts down to let the
crime scene procedures begin.

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:46.190
The frenzy of paparazzi provides a distraction
for Tiffany and her boys to sneak out and

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:48.360
stow themselves away in Jennifer Tilly’s
limo.

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:52.570
Tiffany is dazzled by the sight of the Hollywood
sunset, and it seems to inspire her to develop

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:56.980
a new plan to be apart of that SoCal stardom
by transferring her soul into Jennifer Tilly’s

00:23:56.980 --> 00:24:00.720
body and for Chucky to take over the body
of rapper / movie producer Redman so that

00:24:00.720 --> 00:24:04.020
they can be the most powerful couple in Hollywood,
or something.

00:24:04.020 --> 00:24:07.650
However, that leaves Glen still needing a
body, and Tiffany doesn’t want to get pregnant

00:24:07.650 --> 00:24:12.040
again, so she plans to knock up Jennifer before
performing the soul transfer ritual, using

00:24:12.040 --> 00:24:15.940
her as what she calls a “surrogate mother”,
and what the rest of us call “human trafficking”.

00:24:15.940 --> 00:24:20.240
I think sometimes Tiffany likes to recontextualize
the horrible things she does to distract her

00:24:20.240 --> 00:24:24.039
from how horrible they are, like earlier on,
when she refers to her killing sprees with

00:24:24.039 --> 00:24:25.400
Chucky as “dates”.

00:24:25.400 --> 00:24:29.659
As they put their child to sleep that evening,
he asks a question they are not prepared for.

00:24:29.659 --> 00:24:31.539
– Why do you kill people?

00:24:31.539 --> 00:24:34.490
– [Zac] Chucky wants his kid to grow up to become
a killer, but Tiffany thinks they should set

00:24:34.490 --> 00:24:38.279
a good example now that they’re parents
and she nags Chucky until he reluctantly agrees

00:24:38.279 --> 00:24:40.610
to stop killing, mostly to shut her up.

00:24:40.610 --> 00:24:44.149
Later that night, Tiffany sends Chucky into
the bathroom with a cup to start the artificial

00:24:44.149 --> 00:24:48.270
insemination process, and later knocks Redman
out with Ms. Tilly’s Most Improved Actress

00:24:48.270 --> 00:24:49.270
Award.

00:24:49.270 --> 00:24:52.470
She confronts, and scolds Jennifer on her
lack of self-respect for trying to sleep her

00:24:52.470 --> 00:24:56.809
way into a role, then immediately changes
tones and asks her hero for an autograph,

00:24:56.809 --> 00:24:59.280
which of course, freaks Jennifer the f***
out.

00:24:59.280 --> 00:25:00.890
Maybe that was part of the plan.

00:25:00.890 --> 00:25:04.130
Jennifer just runs for it, so Tiffany once
again displays her impressive cannon of an

00:25:04.130 --> 00:25:06.570
arm and nails her in the back of the head
with the trophy.

00:25:06.570 --> 00:25:09.290
The two dolls drag the unconscious movie stars
to bed.

00:25:09.290 --> 00:25:12.760
Once again, we see the added strength that
the magic of Damballa gives to help them move

00:25:12.760 --> 00:25:14.880
these bodies, but even still…

00:25:14.880 --> 00:25:16.020
– [Tiffany] F*** she’s fat.

00:25:16.020 --> 00:25:17.549
I can’t believe it.

00:25:17.549 --> 00:25:19.470
She’s not even pregnant yet.

00:25:19.470 --> 00:25:23.400
– Tiffany is the one to… uhh… decorate
the cake.

00:25:23.400 --> 00:25:27.450
The next morning is March 19th, and Tiffany’s
plan works; because Jennifer wakes up thinking

00:25:27.450 --> 00:25:30.440
her battle with the 3 foot plastic superfan
was all a dream.

00:25:30.440 --> 00:25:33.230
Meanwhile, Tiff reads up on kicking her addiction
to committing homicide.

00:25:33.230 --> 00:25:37.220
She kind of skims through the first 8 steps,
but the ninth tells her to make amends with

00:25:37.220 --> 00:25:40.870
anyone she may have harmed, so she starts
by calling up Ruth Bailey, the widow of the

00:25:40.870 --> 00:25:43.110
police officer she killed five years earlier.

00:25:43.110 --> 00:25:47.419
Her apology confuses and distresses Ms. Bailey,
but Jennifer seems oblivious, which I see

00:25:47.419 --> 00:25:51.460
as another coping mechanism to help her ignore
how harmful her actions really are.

00:25:51.460 --> 00:25:53.920
In the evening, Jennifer tells Redman she’s
pregnant.

00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:57.320
Again, the signs show up much faster than
usual because the father is being kept alive

00:25:57.320 --> 00:25:59.860
by Voodoo, thus making it a Voodoo pregnancy.

00:25:59.860 --> 00:26:03.350
Redman informs her that he got a vasectomy
so he can’t be the father, and adds that

00:26:03.350 --> 00:26:06.830
she can no longer be in his movie because
in his words,

00:26:06.830 --> 00:26:08.779
– She gotz to be… hot.

00:26:08.779 --> 00:26:12.400
– Tiffany overhears their conversation through
the vent and is outraged, and tempted to kill

00:26:12.400 --> 00:26:16.400
Redman herself, but she resists the urge,
and calls up a support hotline instead.

00:26:16.400 --> 00:26:20.649
The guy she talks to is very unhelpful though,
and almost encourages her, by saying that

00:26:20.649 --> 00:26:23.900
having a slip up is OK because “Rome wasn’t
built in a day.”

00:26:23.900 --> 00:26:27.971
It’s unclear if this is a support hotline
specifically for serial killers, or just a

00:26:27.971 --> 00:26:29.179
hotline for addicts of all types.

00:26:29.179 --> 00:26:33.029
At first I thought it was a line for all types
of addicts, which would explain why he doesn’t

00:26:33.029 --> 00:26:36.570
make a huge deal out of her having a slip
up, but then again I’m not sure what he’s

00:26:36.570 --> 00:26:37.759
talking about with this line:

00:26:37.759 --> 00:26:41.782
– [Man on Phone] Yeah, and believe me, it was not pretty.

00:26:41.782 --> 00:26:45.155
In fact it took me three hours just to clean
up the mess.

00:26:45.155 --> 00:26:48.480
– I guess he could be talking about a mess
he made while he was drunk or something, but

00:26:48.480 --> 00:26:51.399
it almost sounds like it is actually a serial
killer hotline.

00:26:51.399 --> 00:26:56.000
Regardless, his advice encourages Tiffany
to invite herself to dinner with Redman that evening. 

00:26:56.973 --> 00:26:58.813
(fleshy sound)

00:26:58.960 --> 00:27:02.370
Glen notices his mother cutting out Redman’s
intestines, and Tiffany is embarrassed to

00:27:02.370 --> 00:27:06.399
have broken her vow in front of him, an event
that he doesn’t really know how to process.

00:27:06.399 --> 00:27:10.600
The next morning, March 20th, Chucky and Tiffany
watch the execution of Martha Stewart in bed

00:27:10.600 --> 00:27:14.980
when they hear Jennifer’s horrified reaction
at her now very visible pregnancy.

00:27:14.980 --> 00:27:18.360
Jennifer calls her assistant to vent about
the scary new development, and Tiffany joins

00:27:18.360 --> 00:27:22.270
in on the call to confuse and torture them,
since her voice is identical to Jennifer's.

00:27:22.270 --> 00:27:26.340
She finds Chucky tying Jennifer to the bed,
and he accidentally drops a photo of him and

00:27:26.340 --> 00:27:27.789
Glen killing the paparazzi.

00:27:27.789 --> 00:27:31.029
This sets her off because of their agreement
not to kill anymore to set a good example

00:27:31.029 --> 00:27:32.029
for their child.

00:27:32.029 --> 00:27:35.480
A huge argument ensues, and it's not long
before they're back on their disagreement

00:27:35.480 --> 00:27:37.529
of if they should raise a girl or boy.

00:27:37.529 --> 00:27:39.090
There's a lot of irony here.

00:27:39.090 --> 00:27:42.279
After all of her fuss to try to create a good
environment to raise a child by shielding

00:27:42.279 --> 00:27:45.900
him or her from violence, she ends up putting
him or her in the very same kind of environment

00:27:45.900 --> 00:27:49.549
she likely grew up in, a household with two
parents who are constantly fighting.

00:27:49.549 --> 00:27:54.390
Glen states he or she cannot decide what he
or she wants to be, but knows that he or she

00:27:54.390 --> 00:27:57.150
is not a killer and Tiffany says that this
makes her proud.

00:27:57.150 --> 00:28:01.100
Chucky finds Redman’s body hidden in a wardrobe,
so she’s gotta call in a new male body for

00:28:01.100 --> 00:28:04.500
Chucky to transfer into, which would be Jennifer’s
limo driver, Stan.

00:28:04.500 --> 00:28:08.287
– [Tiffany on Phone] Stan, baby, I need your body.

00:28:08.287 --> 00:28:09.690
– I'll be right there.

00:28:09.690 --> 00:28:10.690
– Simp!

00:28:10.690 --> 00:28:14.110
It’s not really clear to me why they still
couldn’t just use Redman, as being alive

00:28:14.110 --> 00:28:17.010
has never been a prerequisite for possessing
a body before.

00:28:17.010 --> 00:28:19.570
How else would they have gotten into doll
bodies in the first place?

00:28:19.570 --> 00:28:22.833
When Stan arrives, they take him prisoner
as well, and Tiffany thinks they’re a cute

00:28:22.833 --> 00:28:24.470
couple, as she did with Jesse and Jade.

00:28:24.470 --> 00:28:28.630
Her mother’s teachings seem to have imparted
this idealized version of love that her toxicity

00:28:28.630 --> 00:28:30.529
prevents her from actually achieving.

00:28:30.529 --> 00:28:34.050
The vitriol between Chucky and Tiffany continues
to build as they prepare for the birth of

00:28:34.050 --> 00:28:37.819
the baby, and subsequently, the three soul
transfer rituals.

00:28:37.819 --> 00:28:41.248
(impact)

00:28:42.656 --> 00:28:46.760
♪ upbeat music ♪

00:28:46.760 --> 00:28:50.500
With Chucky’s call upon the Voodoo powers
of Damballa looming, an interruption arises

00:28:50.500 --> 00:28:53.630
in the form of Jennifer Tilly’s concerned
personal assistant.

00:28:53.630 --> 00:28:56.710
Chucky finds a hiding spot so that he can
surprise and take care of her, while Tiffany

00:28:56.710 --> 00:28:58.070
steps out of the room to grab a drink.

00:28:58.070 --> 00:29:01.650
When she comes back, she’s faced with a
very different situation.

00:29:01.650 --> 00:29:06.040
Glen has now changed his identity and appearance
to Glenda, in order to murder Jen’s assistant

00:29:06.040 --> 00:29:07.320
with a makeshift flamethrower.

00:29:07.320 --> 00:29:10.419
(glass shatters) – What did I miss?

00:29:10.419 --> 00:29:14.269
– Tiffany is taken aback by this psychotic
new behavior, even if she did get what she

00:29:14.269 --> 00:29:16.929
wanted by Glen choosing the female identity.

00:29:16.929 --> 00:29:20.500
She slaps Glenda in the face, telling her
to wake up, and this seems to revert her back

00:29:20.500 --> 00:29:21.620
into being Glen.

00:29:21.620 --> 00:29:24.340
Essentially, there are two identities living
in one body.

00:29:24.340 --> 00:29:27.510
If you’ve seen Psycho, it helped inspire
this concept, which I talk more about in the

00:29:27.510 --> 00:29:29.820
Things You Missed episode on Seed of Chucky.

00:29:29.820 --> 00:29:32.980
Before they have time to really sort this
out, it’s time to deliver the baby, and

00:29:32.980 --> 00:29:34.460
Tiffany serves as the midwife.

00:29:34.460 --> 00:29:36.982
– It’s a boy!

00:29:36.982 --> 00:29:39.730
– Yes, we can tell by the blue blanket that
you somehow have.

00:29:39.730 --> 00:29:43.929
However, to Tiffany’s surprise, there’s
also a second twin, this one a girl.

00:29:43.929 --> 00:29:48.710
With three human bodies collected, plus one
extra, it’s time to perform the Voodoo ritual.

00:29:48.710 --> 00:29:52.640
Tiffany interrupts to allow Glenda the opportunity
to choose which twin she wants to inhabit,

00:29:52.640 --> 00:29:56.029
but realizes that since they have the amulet,
this choice doesn’t have to be permanent.

00:29:56.029 --> 00:30:00.070
The cops show up, so she rushes Chucky along
to perform the ritual, and with everyone screaming

00:30:00.070 --> 00:30:02.581
at him he snaps and backs out of the whole
thing.

00:30:02.581 --> 00:30:06.090
She’s unwilling to change her course,
she has seen the opportunity for Hollywood

00:30:06.090 --> 00:30:10.320
stardom, and she chooses that life over an
eternity as a doll and breaks up with Chucky.

00:30:10.320 --> 00:30:11.950
– It’s over…

00:30:11.950 --> 00:30:13.740
– There’s just one problem.

00:30:13.740 --> 00:30:15.220
You don’t break up with the Chuck.

00:30:15.220 --> 00:30:19.020
He attempts to throw the knife at her, but
she’s saved by Stan breaking free at just

00:30:19.020 --> 00:30:22.360
the right time… or from his point of view,
just the wrong time.

00:30:22.360 --> 00:30:26.100
She throws the blade back at her now ex-doll,
but with the police just outside, and on their

00:30:26.100 --> 00:30:28.780
way upstairs, all three toys have to duck
out.

00:30:28.780 --> 00:30:31.820
Tiffany and Glen are able to hitch a ride
with the ambulance and sneak into the hospital

00:30:31.820 --> 00:30:33.860
room where Jennifer Tilly is being tended
to.

00:30:33.860 --> 00:30:37.000
They hide under the bed and listen in on the
latest information: the police have somehow

00:30:37.000 --> 00:30:41.049
cleared her of being the killer, despite being
the only witness of the FX guy’s death,

00:30:41.049 --> 00:30:44.740
Redman’s death, her limo driver’s death,
her assistant’s death, and three other people

00:30:44.740 --> 00:30:48.640
found dead in her home, which makes no sense,
but the police aren’t convinced she’s

00:30:48.640 --> 00:30:52.010
mentally competent and might not let her see
her newborn children.

00:30:52.010 --> 00:30:55.510
Tiffany injects something into her IV, which
causes her to pass out and once again tries

00:30:55.510 --> 00:30:57.630
to proceed with the soul transfer ritual.

00:30:57.630 --> 00:30:59.789
– [Tiffany] And switch!

00:30:59.789 --> 00:31:00.789
Switch!

00:31:00.789 --> 00:31:02.659
Switch, switch switch!

00:31:02.659 --> 00:31:06.040
– Like her initial spell to try to reawaken
Chucky, there’s something about how Tiffany

00:31:06.040 --> 00:31:09.710
performs the ritual that causes the effects
to be delayed, and this allows Chucky time

00:31:09.710 --> 00:31:11.970
to get inside and lodge an ax into her head.

00:31:11.970 --> 00:31:16.260
With her dying words, she tells Glen to be
a good girl, or boy, and not to make the same

00:31:16.260 --> 00:31:17.990
mistakes she and Chucky did.

00:31:17.990 --> 00:31:19.520
– Especially your dad.

00:31:19.520 --> 00:31:22.500
– But these aren’t really her last words,
obviously.

00:31:22.500 --> 00:31:24.429
As you can see there is more time left in
the video.

00:31:24.429 --> 00:31:28.149
The soul transfer takes effect and she rolls
over, now in Jennifer's Body.

00:31:28.149 --> 00:31:29.149
Not you.

00:31:29.149 --> 00:31:30.149
Jennifer Tilly’s body.

00:31:30.149 --> 00:31:34.110
But seeing his mother get chopped up awakens
something inside of Glen and he goes ninja

00:31:34.110 --> 00:31:35.110
mode.

00:31:35.110 --> 00:31:39.880
Tiff slides him the ax and he uses it to finish
Chucky once and for… well… once.

00:31:39.880 --> 00:31:43.740
After the deed is done, she tries to console
her son, who is surely full of confusing emotions

00:31:43.740 --> 00:31:44.740
at this point.

00:31:44.740 --> 00:31:48.039
We can assume they next took the amulet to
the nursery to transfer Glen and Glenda into

00:31:48.039 --> 00:31:49.070
their human bodies.

00:31:49.070 --> 00:31:52.049
When the ritual was performed, they really
did switch places.

00:31:52.049 --> 00:31:56.169
At first it appeared that Jennifer Tilly switched
into the doll body, then died immediately,

00:31:56.169 --> 00:31:59.779
but apparently she actually survived, and
Tiffany held onto the doll to use Jennifer

00:31:59.779 --> 00:32:01.010
to her advantage.

00:32:01.010 --> 00:32:04.960
She put her to work, forcing her to do her
taxes, play online poker and even do voice

00:32:04.960 --> 00:32:06.720
over work as Bonnie on Family Guy.

00:32:06.720 --> 00:32:10.240
And all this so Tiffany could live the life
of luxury for years to come!

00:32:10.240 --> 00:32:13.410
Tiffany took over Jennifer Tilly's life; but
she was really worried that Jennifer's close

00:32:13.410 --> 00:32:16.309
relatives would notice something was off about
her behavior.

00:32:16.309 --> 00:32:19.549
So, to avoid any suspicion, she cut off contact
with them.

00:32:19.549 --> 00:32:22.941
Tiffany didn't want the twins to feel lonely
and without a sense of extended family, so

00:32:22.941 --> 00:32:26.510
she started organizing regular get-togethers
with Jennifer's actor friends.

00:32:26.510 --> 00:32:31.470
The get-togethers included Bound co-stars
Gina Gershon, Sutton Stracke, and Joe Pantoliano,

00:32:31.470 --> 00:32:33.740
and they became like the twins' aunts and
uncles!

00:32:33.740 --> 00:32:37.309
Around this time, it’s likely that the movie,
The Seed Of Chucky, went into production as

00:32:37.309 --> 00:32:39.870
Jennifer Tilly has a Seed of Chucky Poster
in her home.

00:32:39.870 --> 00:32:43.820
I’ll also note that Jennifer Tilly was credited
for being in Bride of Chucky, but I assume

00:32:43.820 --> 00:32:46.099
that came out before Tiffany took over.

00:32:46.099 --> 00:32:50.563
The release dates of these movies in the Chucky universe obviously doesn't align with the release dates in our world.

00:32:50.563 --> 00:32:55.120
All of this happens before the twins' 5th
birthday, on March 20th 2009.

00:32:55.120 --> 00:32:58.400
Tiffany has assumed the life of Jennifer Tilly,
so she’s holding a big party at her Hollywood

00:32:58.400 --> 00:32:59.400
Hills mansion.

00:32:59.400 --> 00:33:03.049
As a single mother, she has hired a new nanny
named, Fulvia, to help look after the kids,

00:33:03.049 --> 00:33:05.679
who loves Glen, but literally fears Glenda.

00:33:05.679 --> 00:33:09.490
Tiffany uses the doll to beat down Fulvia
in an act of revenge for her disloyalty.

00:33:09.490 --> 00:33:13.240
At the time, it appeared to be just an object,
not moving and not alive.

00:33:13.240 --> 00:33:16.750
It’s possible that this was Jennifer though, holding
entirely still.

00:33:16.750 --> 00:33:19.820
Or maybe she just acquired multiple wedding
Belle dolls during this time.

00:33:20.000 --> 00:33:23.720
She once again writes this off as a little
slip, so she’s continuing to use “Rome

00:33:23.720 --> 00:33:26.810
wasn’t built in a day” as an excuse to
continue her killing career.

00:33:26.810 --> 00:33:30.020
It seems she has an understanding with Glenda,
the murderous of the two kids, to keep all

00:33:30.020 --> 00:33:33.270
this quiet, maintaining the illusion of a
perfect family for Glen, which is what he

00:33:33.270 --> 00:33:34.580
wants more than anything.

00:33:34.580 --> 00:33:38.440
She likely continued living as a Hollywood
movie star and poorly parenting her kids through

00:33:38.440 --> 00:33:39.500
the turn of the decade.

00:33:39.500 --> 00:33:42.980
At some point, she went back across the country
to retrieve her car, which was left outside

00:33:42.980 --> 00:33:45.019
her old trailer in Lockport, New York.

00:33:45.019 --> 00:33:49.044
Glen and Glenda would be eight years old at
the beginning of 2013, when Chucky next pops up.

00:33:49.044 --> 00:33:52.460
We don’t know if there was an event that
caused Tiff to get back together with him,

00:33:52.460 --> 00:33:55.570
yet again, after their dramatic breakup nearly
a decade before.

00:33:55.570 --> 00:33:59.130
All we know is that Chucky somehow shows up
at the front door of the woman he was seeing

00:33:59.130 --> 00:34:02.360
in 1988 right before he got killed, Sarah
Pierce.

00:34:02.360 --> 00:34:05.909
It’s possible that somebody helped pack
and mail Chucky to Sarah's doorstep, but if

00:34:05.909 --> 00:34:09.780
that is the case, I don’t think it was Tiffany
that helped him, because as I alluded to earlier,

00:34:09.780 --> 00:34:13.310
I don't think Tiffany ever knew about Sarah,
and Chucky wouldn't want to put himself in

00:34:13.310 --> 00:34:17.570
a situation where Tiffany starts asking questions
about who this woman actually is.

00:34:17.570 --> 00:34:19.889
There's no way she would help him once she
found out.

00:34:19.889 --> 00:34:23.070
Chucky doesn’t necessarily need Tiffany’s
help to package and mail himself.

00:34:23.070 --> 00:34:26.770
For example, in Child’s Play 3, he mails
himself to the military academy despite not

00:34:26.770 --> 00:34:28.020
having connected with her yet.

00:34:28.020 --> 00:34:32.010
We can only assume he tricks someone else
into helping him, or somehow does it himself,

00:34:32.010 --> 00:34:33.550
it’s not really explained.

00:34:33.550 --> 00:34:37.649
Anyways, after arriving in Rhode Island, Chucky
massacres the Pierce family and the only survivors

00:34:37.649 --> 00:34:40.720
are Sarah’s daughter, Nica Pierce, and granddaughter,
Alice Pierce.

00:34:40.720 --> 00:34:44.859
There’s a very public trial in April 2013,
where the Chucky doll is used as a key piece

00:34:44.859 --> 00:34:48.240
of evidence as Nica is blamed for the murders
and ruled to be insane.

00:34:48.240 --> 00:34:52.139
Tiffany probably heard about this in the news,
realized Chucky was back and started to fall

00:34:52.139 --> 00:34:54.419
for him again because she can’t resist a
killer.

00:34:54.419 --> 00:34:56.240
It's an inescapable cycle for her.

00:34:56.240 --> 00:35:00.270
On April 6th or 7th, the day that Nica’s
trial ended, she pulls out an old trick by

00:35:00.270 --> 00:35:03.869
bribing a police officer to bring her the
evidence -- aka: the Chucky doll -- before

00:35:03.869 --> 00:35:07.450
grabbing him from behind and slashing his
throat, the same thing she did to Robert Bailey

00:35:07.450 --> 00:35:08.920
14 years before.

00:35:08.920 --> 00:35:12.710
Presumably, Chucky and Tiffany rekindle their
relationship and Tiffany agrees to help with

00:35:12.710 --> 00:35:16.420
his plan by mailing him to his next destination,
where Chucky tricks Alice into letting him

00:35:16.420 --> 00:35:18.630
perform the chant to take over her body.

00:35:18.630 --> 00:35:22.900
After doing so, Tiffany goes through the adoption
process to become Alice’s legal guardian,

00:35:22.900 --> 00:35:24.790
using the name Tiffany Valentine.

00:35:24.790 --> 00:35:28.420
Important note: she does not sign the adoption
paperwork as the movie star: Jennifer Tilly.

00:35:28.420 --> 00:35:31.430
– Did anyone ever tell you you look exactly
like Jennifer Tilly?

00:35:31.430 --> 00:35:33.190
– Yeah, I get that a lot.

00:35:33.190 --> 00:35:36.339
– Remember when I said that Chucky and Tiffany
hiding Tiffany’s original human body would

00:35:36.339 --> 00:35:37.460
be important later?

00:35:37.460 --> 00:35:38.460
This is why.

00:35:38.460 --> 00:35:42.642
Tiffany is an expert at disposing of human
remains, so nobody ever finds her original corpe.

00:35:42.642 --> 00:35:46.320
This allows her to be Jennifer in her day
to day life, but also be Tiffany whenever

00:35:46.320 --> 00:35:47.430
it’s convenient for her.

00:35:47.430 --> 00:35:50.820
If Jennifer had tried to adopt Alice, there
would have been a huge spotlight on her, and

00:35:50.820 --> 00:35:54.500
if something were to happen to Alice, it wouldn’t
look good, considering that Ms. Tilly was

00:35:54.500 --> 00:35:57.940
the sole witness of 6 murders that took place
in her house in 2004.

00:35:57.940 --> 00:36:01.740
But since Tiffany is the one adopting the
child, people aren’t really gonna be paying attention.

00:36:01.740 --> 00:36:05.349
This also goes back to what I said earlier
about Tiffany not distinguishing romantic

00:36:05.349 --> 00:36:06.500
love from motherly love.

00:36:06.500 --> 00:36:10.450
From the outside, it’s a random woman taking
in an orphaned little girl, but from her point

00:36:10.450 --> 00:36:13.160
of view, she’s adopting her lover, which
is weird.

00:36:13.160 --> 00:36:16.880
After Alice’s usefulness eventually runs
its course, she is allegedly killed, something

00:36:16.880 --> 00:36:19.130
that Tiffany later expresses regret for.

00:36:19.130 --> 00:36:21.480
Even here, she can’t fully suppress her
motherly instincts.

00:36:21.480 --> 00:36:25.860
I’m assuming Tiffany was also the person
to mail one duplicate Chucky to Andy Barclay’s

00:36:25.860 --> 00:36:31.180
apartment six months later on November 8th
2013, though, it didn't end well for him.

00:36:31.180 --> 00:36:32.180
– Andy?

00:36:32.180 --> 00:36:33.180
(gunshot)

00:36:33.180 --> 00:36:35.710
– This doesn’t really matter though, because
by this time, Chucky has discovered a new

00:36:35.710 --> 00:36:40.214
spell on Voodoo for Dummies.com that allows
him to split his soul into multiple different bodies.

00:36:40.214 --> 00:36:43.610
Tiffany would also find uses for this spell,
and Chucky and Tiffany’s relationship would

00:36:43.610 --> 00:36:46.103
get a whole lot more interesting.

00:36:46.103 --> 00:36:49.429
(impact)

00:36:51.494 --> 00:36:55.233
♪ eerie music ♪

00:36:55.619 --> 00:36:59.090
By the year 2017, Tiffany and Chucky are somehow
still on good terms.

00:36:59.090 --> 00:37:00.960
Or at least they’re back on good terms.

00:37:00.960 --> 00:37:03.450
Who knows how many times they broke up from
2013-2017.

00:37:03.450 --> 00:37:08.744
Chucky’s new plan is to create an entire
army of Chucky dolls using the new VoodooForDummies.com spell.

00:37:08.744 --> 00:37:12.369
It seems there’s a limit to how many times
he can replicate his soul individually, but

00:37:12.369 --> 00:37:15.730
if he can get an innocent to kill for him,
he can automatically possess a massive number

00:37:15.730 --> 00:37:16.730
of dolls.

00:37:16.730 --> 00:37:18.160
Tiffany is in on this plan.

00:37:18.160 --> 00:37:21.520
She does her part by visiting the psychiatric
hospital where Nica Pierce is being held in

00:37:21.520 --> 00:37:23.619
captivity on January 23rd.

00:37:23.619 --> 00:37:27.070
When Nica enters the room, Tiffany can be
seen sharpening her deadly nail file, and

00:37:27.070 --> 00:37:29.410
she’s all dressed up in red, her favorite
color.

00:37:29.410 --> 00:37:31.470
Guess goth was just a phase.

00:37:31.470 --> 00:37:34.740
In this scene she’s playing the role of
Alice's mother, Tiffany Valentine.

00:37:34.740 --> 00:37:38.390
As far as the public record is concerned,
this woman has never been married, so she

00:37:38.390 --> 00:37:40.700
doesn’t go by Tiffany Ray when using this
identity.

00:37:40.700 --> 00:37:45.190
From the get-go, the two don’t get along,
and Tiffany casually drops that Alice is dead,

00:37:45.190 --> 00:37:46.490
which devastates Nica.

00:37:46.490 --> 00:37:50.119
She fakes a few tears of her own and says
that she suspects Alice’s death was due

00:37:50.119 --> 00:37:51.369
to a broken heart.

00:37:51.369 --> 00:37:54.010
Essentially, she wants Nica to feel like she’s
responsible.

00:37:54.010 --> 00:37:55.869
But messing with Nica was just a bonus.

00:37:55.869 --> 00:37:59.920
The real purpose of the trip was to smuggle
a new Chucky doll into the mental hospital.

00:37:59.920 --> 00:38:04.680
– [Dr Foley] That’s not the same--
– [Tiffany] No, no, this is a doll that they used

00:38:04.680 --> 00:38:05.869
in Alice’s therapy.

00:38:05.869 --> 00:38:08.319
To help her get over the past.

00:38:08.319 --> 00:38:11.849
She thought that maybe, it would help you
too.

00:38:11.849 --> 00:38:13.410
– With her mission accomplished, she leaves.

00:38:13.410 --> 00:38:18.335
Two days later, on January 25th, she gives
Andy Barclay a call and introduces herself as

00:38:18.335 --> 00:38:19.835
– Tiffany?

00:38:20.395 --> 00:38:22.200
Jennifer?

00:38:22.200 --> 00:38:23.779
Even I lose track.

00:38:23.779 --> 00:38:27.000
– Which means she has probably been freely
switching between the two quite a lot.

00:38:27.000 --> 00:38:29.730
I guess nobody noticed that Tiffany got her
tattoo removed.

00:38:29.730 --> 00:38:33.190
Andy says he knows who she is and he’s coming
for her and Chucky, which she responds to

00:38:33.190 --> 00:38:37.351
by informing him that there are three of them
at the moment: Chucky, Tiffany and a second Chucky.

00:38:37.351 --> 00:38:41.350
She invites Andy to join the cult, which he
refuses, so she delivers a message from Chucky:

00:38:41.350 --> 00:38:46.690
– It’s just a single word: disembowel.

00:38:46.690 --> 00:38:50.079
– Chucky continues to carry out his plan
by inhabiting multiple dolls inside Harrogate

00:38:50.079 --> 00:38:51.079
Hospital.

00:38:51.079 --> 00:38:54.574
The only other thing Tiffany does at that
time is split her own soul into another body.

00:38:54.574 --> 00:38:56.400
Remember how I said she got a second wedding Belle doll?

00:38:56.400 --> 00:39:00.030
It’s a good insurance policy to have a backup
in case either of them gets killed.

00:39:00.030 --> 00:39:03.520
When the time comes to get out of Harrogate,
Tiffany essentially plays the role of getaway

00:39:03.520 --> 00:39:06.490
driver, which may have brought them closer
together, because she was there for him where

00:39:06.490 --> 00:39:08.420
his old driver, Eddie Caputo, was not.

00:39:08.420 --> 00:39:09.420
I mean…

00:39:09.420 --> 00:39:12.890
He wouldn’t have been on the run in 1988
in the first place if it wasn’t for Tiffany,

00:39:12.890 --> 00:39:14.700
but it’s a nice gesture nonetheless.

00:39:14.700 --> 00:39:17.510
OK, not really, they’re both ****ing cancer.

00:39:17.510 --> 00:39:20.750
Chucky walks out after possessing the body
of Nica, and Tiffany is just happy to have

00:39:20.750 --> 00:39:23.969
her man back in a human body, it didn’t
matter that it was a woman’s body this time

00:39:23.969 --> 00:39:27.420
-- we saw very early on in her history that
she’s a bisexual.

00:39:27.420 --> 00:39:31.079
Like that first encounter, they make out next
to dead body, in this case, the Harrogate

00:39:31.079 --> 00:39:32.220
Hospital security guard.

00:39:32.220 --> 00:39:35.329
I hope they didn’t do this kind of stuff
when Chucky possessed Alice.

00:39:35.329 --> 00:39:39.720
If you’re like me, you’ve probably wondered
at some point during this story how law enforcement

00:39:39.720 --> 00:39:41.839
can be so totally imcompetent.

00:39:41.839 --> 00:39:44.660
Charles Lee Ray was a well known serial killer
in the 80s.

00:39:44.660 --> 00:39:47.550
Tiffany had many of her own run-ins with the
law during that time.

00:39:47.550 --> 00:39:48.980
Surely someone saw them together.

00:39:48.980 --> 00:39:53.800
Surely, someone noticed that her disappearance
in 1999 coincided with the appearance of Charles

00:39:53.800 --> 00:39:56.770
Lee Ray’s fingerprints at many new crime
scenes.

00:39:56.770 --> 00:40:00.990
Surely eyebrows were raised when Tiffany Valentine
reappeared out of nowhere to adopt the last

00:40:00.990 --> 00:40:03.790
remaining family member of Charles Lee Ray’s
late mistress.

00:40:03.790 --> 00:40:08.920
Well it seems that at some point between 2017
and 2021, investigators finally connected

00:40:08.920 --> 00:40:13.354
those dots, and Tiffany Valentine is identified
as a “known accomplice” to Charles Lee Ray.

00:40:13.354 --> 00:40:15.320
This information goes public on the internet.

00:40:15.320 --> 00:40:19.160
She’s no longer able to use that identity,
so she continues going by Jennifer Tilly in

00:40:19.160 --> 00:40:21.150
public, and Tiffany Ray around Chucky.

00:40:21.150 --> 00:40:24.440
My theory is that Andy was the one to point
police to the fact that Charles and Tiffany

00:40:24.440 --> 00:40:27.740
are affiliated, because when she talks to
him on the phone in Cult, he tells her, “I

00:40:27.740 --> 00:40:28.829
know who you are.”

00:40:28.829 --> 00:40:33.660
In March 2021, Glen and Glenda turn 17, so
Tiffany can go away on trips more often and

00:40:33.660 --> 00:40:35.410
not have to worry as much about them as much.

00:40:35.410 --> 00:40:39.849
At some point, she takes Chucky back to Hackensack
to revisit the early parts of their relationship.

00:40:39.849 --> 00:40:43.030
Since there are multiple Chuckys now, I’ll
refer to this version as Nica-Chucky.

00:40:43.030 --> 00:40:46.910
Nica occasionally takes the driver’s seat,
which Tiffany kind of likes, but pretends

00:40:46.910 --> 00:40:48.316
not to notice, for now.

00:40:48.316 --> 00:40:54.829
– Sometimes when we’re together I see
you looking at me.

00:40:54.829 --> 00:40:57.950
And I know it’s you.

00:40:57.950 --> 00:41:05.740
It’s not Chucky, it’s you, and I live
for those moments.

00:41:05.740 --> 00:41:08.911
– If you thought it was not possible for
Chucky and Tiffany’s relationship to get

00:41:08.911 --> 00:41:11.620
any more weird and toxic, think again!

00:41:11.620 --> 00:41:15.119
Despite this, she continues helping Chucky
with his masterplan to terrorize America with

00:41:15.119 --> 00:41:16.410
an army of Chucky dolls.

00:41:16.410 --> 00:41:19.630
To do this, she meets with Hackensack’s
mayor, Michelle Cross to propose a benefit

00:41:19.630 --> 00:41:20.930
screening and auction.

00:41:20.930 --> 00:41:24.069
The proceeds of the screening are supposed
to fund Better Days Childrens’ Hospitals,

00:41:24.069 --> 00:41:26.620
with the dolls being sent to sick kids across
the US.

00:41:26.620 --> 00:41:29.510
Each one is a vintage Good Guy doll from Jennifer’s
personal collection.

00:41:29.510 --> 00:41:33.420
If the plan works as they hope, each of these
72 dolls will be possessed with Charles Lee

00:41:33.420 --> 00:41:34.420
Ray’s soul.

00:41:34.420 --> 00:41:37.710
Although her feelings for Chucky are mixed,
Tiffany could never pass up an opportunity

00:41:37.710 --> 00:41:41.420
like this to spread mayhem, and from Mayor
Cross’s point of view, it’s a good PR

00:41:41.420 --> 00:41:44.890
stunt to promote her re-election, a distraction
from the fact that the death toll in her city

00:41:44.890 --> 00:41:46.069
has been on the rise.

00:41:46.069 --> 00:41:48.040
The charity event is scheduled for Mid November.

00:41:48.040 --> 00:41:52.180
On November 8th, 2021, Chucky and Tiffany
are back in the hotel room where they first

00:41:52.180 --> 00:41:56.230
made love, this time with a new prisoner,
and the old arguments start up again, this

00:41:56.230 --> 00:41:59.540
time about Jennifer’s weight, which has
basically been on a steady incline.

00:41:59.540 --> 00:42:03.550
The next day, she cuts their guest up into
smaller pieces to try to pack him into a suitcase,

00:42:03.550 --> 00:42:06.590
and her inability to do so, combined with
Chucky’s unwillingness to help, leads to

00:42:06.590 --> 00:42:08.330
more fighting, causing her to storm off yet
again.

00:42:08.330 --> 00:42:12.250
It’s basically the same fight about the
dishes, still going on over two decades later.

00:42:12.250 --> 00:42:16.010
In mid November, Tiff puts her Monsters Inc
residuals to good use and buys Charles Lee

00:42:16.010 --> 00:42:20.502
Ray’s childhood home in Hackensack to use
as a base of operations for their ever expanding cult. 

00:42:20.502 --> 00:42:24.290
Before the deal closes, she sits around with
Chucky in their hotel playing poker -- a reference

00:42:24.290 --> 00:42:27.930
to the real life Jennifer Tilly’s side career
as a professional poker player -- when she

00:42:27.930 --> 00:42:30.270
notices that Nica has covertly taken the driver’s
seat.

00:42:30.270 --> 00:42:34.130
It is probably her poker skills that allow
her to easily detect when control switches

00:42:34.130 --> 00:42:35.530
from Chucky to Nica.

00:42:35.530 --> 00:42:39.339
In a 2007 appearance on The Late Late Show
with Craig Ferguson, she discusses how she

00:42:39.339 --> 00:42:42.950
worked with a celebrity profiler to learn
how to read her opponents’ body language,

00:42:42.950 --> 00:42:46.830
so she probably picked up on the subtle differences
in behavior between Chucky and Nica.

00:42:46.830 --> 00:42:49.740
Nica is disabled from the waist down, but
only when she has the wheel.

00:42:49.740 --> 00:42:52.070
When Chucky is in control, he can use Nica’s
legs freely.

00:42:52.070 --> 00:42:56.390
To test her theory, Tiffany sticks a knife
into Nica’s leg, and as expected, gets no

00:42:56.390 --> 00:42:57.390
reaction.

00:42:57.390 --> 00:43:00.799
Before revealing that she knows it’s Nica,
she plays along and tests her a bit, learning

00:43:00.799 --> 00:43:05.109
that Nica drinks less beer, bites her nails,
and takes bigger risks, at least in poker.

00:43:05.109 --> 00:43:08.440
She’s able to trick Nica into revealing
her true self, because Tiffany has a great

00:43:08.440 --> 00:43:09.440
poker face.

00:43:09.440 --> 00:43:12.960
She’s not only bluffing in the card game,
but also in their conversation.

00:43:12.960 --> 00:43:16.220
Jennifer Tilly won her first professional
poker tournament in 2005, which works well

00:43:16.220 --> 00:43:17.220
with her timeline.

00:43:17.220 --> 00:43:21.010
In the Chucky universe, this is one year after
Tiffany possessed her body, so we can assume

00:43:21.010 --> 00:43:23.640
that it was actually Tiffany who made her
great at poker.

00:43:23.640 --> 00:43:27.220
Eventually, Tiffany reveals that she knows
it’s Nica -- and gets choked up as she explains

00:43:27.220 --> 00:43:29.200
that she actually prefers being with Nica.

00:43:29.200 --> 00:43:31.279
– I live for those moments.

00:43:31.279 --> 00:43:34.930
– She claims that she actually bought the
Sherwood Lane house to share with Nica, not

00:43:34.930 --> 00:43:37.520
Chucky, but honestly, I don’t know that
she’s even telling the truth about that,

00:43:37.520 --> 00:43:39.400
because she’s kind of unraveling at this
point.

00:43:39.400 --> 00:43:40.400
Or at least…

00:43:40.400 --> 00:43:41.400
unraveling more than usual.

00:43:41.400 --> 00:43:44.680
She says she wants to find a way to keep Nica
in the driver’s seat, instead of that rat

00:43:44.680 --> 00:43:47.930
Chucky, but then she proceeds to randomly
knock Nica out with a frying pan.

00:43:47.930 --> 00:43:49.839
I think she’s conflicted about what she
wants.

00:43:49.839 --> 00:43:53.819
I know this is a character analysis video,
but she’s become so unhinged from the constant

00:43:53.819 --> 00:43:57.090
opening and closing the door on her relationship
with Chucky, that it almost doesn’t make

00:43:57.090 --> 00:43:59.770
sense to try to make sense of her at this
stage.

00:43:59.770 --> 00:44:03.540
If I had to take a stab at it though, no pun
intended, it seems like she wants to help

00:44:03.540 --> 00:44:07.210
raise Chucky’s army because she likes spreading
terror, but she’s leaning towards Nica from

00:44:07.210 --> 00:44:08.900
a relationship standpoint.

00:44:08.900 --> 00:44:12.119
After picking up the keys to her new house,
she ties Nica to a chair in the living room,

00:44:12.119 --> 00:44:13.920
and leaves her with a kiss before heading
out.

00:44:13.920 --> 00:44:16.940
We don’t know exactly where she goes, but
my assumption is that she’s meeting with

00:44:16.940 --> 00:44:19.930
Mayor Cross to make sure they’re still on
for benefit screening, which would serve as

00:44:19.930 --> 00:44:22.840
a positive distraction from the recent set
of murders that have plagued the town over

00:44:22.840 --> 00:44:26.540
the last month or so, which of course, were
caused by Chucky, who is still trying to convince

00:44:26.540 --> 00:44:28.990
an innocent soul to kill as part of his ritual.

00:44:28.990 --> 00:44:32.600
Tiffany’s next move is to help Chucky move
this along, this time not with her poker skills,

00:44:32.600 --> 00:44:34.768
but with her acting skills.

00:44:34.768 --> 00:44:38.147
(impact)

00:44:39.858 --> 00:44:43.659
♪ eerie piano ♪

00:44:43.659 --> 00:44:47.240
Chucky’s new main target is middle school
student Jake Wheeler, who purchased another

00:44:47.240 --> 00:44:49.559
incarnation of the doll at a yard sale in
October.

00:44:49.559 --> 00:44:53.500
I like to refer to this one as Cope-Chucky,
the same Chucky that Alice supposedly used

00:44:53.500 --> 00:44:55.359
to cope with the massacre of her family.

00:44:55.359 --> 00:44:59.510
In an attempt to make Jake more emotionally
distraught, Cope-Chucky kills Jake’s father,

00:44:59.510 --> 00:45:01.860
then kills the aunt that took him in, Bree
Wheeler.

00:45:01.860 --> 00:45:06.160
However, Jake still refuses to kill, but Chucky
realizes there may be another child who will:

00:45:06.160 --> 00:45:07.380
Jake’s cousin, Junior.

00:45:07.380 --> 00:45:10.390
Tiffany plays a part in driving Junior to
the brink of homicide.

00:45:10.390 --> 00:45:13.810
One day, not long after buying the house,
Tiffany shows up at Bree’s wake.

00:45:13.810 --> 00:45:17.300
She makes a big entrance, walks up smiling
to the grieving widower, and plants a kiss

00:45:17.300 --> 00:45:18.400
on his lips.

00:45:18.400 --> 00:45:21.580
Although her motive isn’t clear at the moment,
this is part of a larger effort to piss off

00:45:21.580 --> 00:45:25.150
Junior, and turn him against his dad by making
him think his mother killed herself because

00:45:25.150 --> 00:45:26.650
Logan was having an affair.

00:45:26.650 --> 00:45:30.270
She continues to push this idea when she brings
over a meal for the mourning family, and Junior

00:45:30.270 --> 00:45:31.680
comes to the door to receive it.

00:45:31.680 --> 00:45:34.700
She tells him that it’s important to have
a woman in the house and plants the idea of

00:45:34.700 --> 00:45:38.630
herself as the mother figure in Junior’s
life, which fires him up because he only just

00:45:38.630 --> 00:45:39.780
lost his mom.

00:45:39.780 --> 00:45:42.750
Tiffany pretends like she’s slipped up and
said too much before leaving.

00:45:42.750 --> 00:45:46.000
This, in combination with Chucky hammering
it home later…

00:45:46.000 --> 00:45:47.670
– Cancer wasn’t enough, huh?

00:45:47.670 --> 00:45:50.109
You had to cheat on her too.

00:45:50.109 --> 00:45:51.519
Real classy, Dad.

00:45:51.519 --> 00:45:55.520
– …finally pushes Junior to kill his Dad
and completes Chucky’s Voodoo ritual.

00:45:55.520 --> 00:45:59.680
This all ties into the part Jennifer Tilly
is supposed to play at the benefit screening.

00:45:59.680 --> 00:46:03.160
That evening, Tiffany comes home and discovers
Nica-Chucky has gotten out of the chair and

00:46:03.160 --> 00:46:04.640
finds her laying on the ground.

00:46:04.640 --> 00:46:08.460
She assumes Nica is in control, unable to
get up due to her paralyzed legs, but this

00:46:08.460 --> 00:46:12.981
assumption ends up being incorrect when she
receives a powerful kick, knocking her to the ground.

00:46:12.981 --> 00:46:16.320
This is Chucky, and he straddles her with
a knife and threatens to kill her for the

00:46:16.320 --> 00:46:17.510
fourth time.

00:46:17.510 --> 00:46:21.700
Tiffany begs that he can’t kill her because
he still needs her, and she’s absolutely correct.

00:46:21.700 --> 00:46:24.019
– Think about it.

00:46:24.019 --> 00:46:25.769
– Thinking is for losers.

00:46:25.769 --> 00:46:26.771
(Tiffany screams)

00:46:26.771 --> 00:46:28.335
– [Chucky] Think again!

00:46:28.335 --> 00:46:30.270
She’s right, bro.

00:46:30.270 --> 00:46:31.349
We need her.

00:46:31.349 --> 00:46:34.569
– It’s interesting how she’s developed
this animosity towards the Charles Lee Ray

00:46:34.569 --> 00:46:38.660
living in Nica’s body, but when she sees
one inside a doll body, she lights up and

00:46:38.660 --> 00:46:39.940
refers to him as Sweetface.

00:46:39.940 --> 00:46:43.010
They’re the same person, it’s just that
she’s been spending a lot of time with the

00:46:43.010 --> 00:46:46.970
one in Nica’s body, so their toxic relationship
has turned them against each other.

00:46:46.970 --> 00:46:49.059
– F*** you Chucky!

00:46:49.059 --> 00:46:51.150
– Thank you Chucky.

00:46:51.150 --> 00:46:54.530
– This is also the example I brought up
earlier in this lesson; Chucky is a romantic

00:46:54.530 --> 00:46:56.920
partner to her, but she treats him like a
baby.

00:46:56.920 --> 00:46:59.766
– Come to mama! Who's a little Good Guy?

00:46:59.766 --> 00:47:01.150
– It’s just weird man.

00:47:01.150 --> 00:47:04.060
She takes Cope-Chucky downstairs to where
the army has awakened.

00:47:04.060 --> 00:47:07.310
She also finds Jake’s friend Devon, who
is tied up, and Junior, who has joined the

00:47:07.310 --> 00:47:08.750
side of the bad guys.

00:47:08.750 --> 00:47:12.140
After Chucky gives a speech to his troops,
Tiffany sees to it that the army of Chuckys

00:47:12.140 --> 00:47:15.640
are packed into the transport truck and stows
away the doll version of herself to facilitate

00:47:15.640 --> 00:47:17.700
things, in case the plan gets off track.

00:47:17.700 --> 00:47:20.250
She plans to meet the driver the following
day at the theater.

00:47:20.250 --> 00:47:22.480
Back in the basement, it’s basically a party
for the bad guys.

00:47:22.480 --> 00:47:26.970
She tries to talk to Cope-Chucky, who brushes
her off, as he’s busy catching up with Nica-Chucky.

00:47:26.970 --> 00:47:31.030
She gets especially butthurt when Nica-Chucky
brags about being able to pick up women, even

00:47:31.030 --> 00:47:32.160
in a woman’s body.

00:47:32.160 --> 00:47:35.450
Tiffany mentions that girl on girl isn’t
the only thing Nica-Chucky is getting…

00:47:35.450 --> 00:47:36.780
She’s talking about peni--

00:47:36.780 --> 00:47:40.100
This causes Tiffany to blow up on Nica-Chucky
and slap him, which seems to knock Chucky

00:47:40.100 --> 00:47:42.660
out of the driver’s seat and give control
back to Nica.

00:47:42.660 --> 00:47:45.540
– At least she treats me with a little respect.

00:47:45.540 --> 00:47:49.690
– Cope-Chucky senses what’s going on between
Nica and Tiffany and offers an apology for

00:47:49.690 --> 00:47:52.820
his self-righteous attitude, but it comes
with a caveat.

00:47:52.820 --> 00:47:53.820
– Kill her.

00:47:53.820 --> 00:47:55.890
You know what that does to me.

00:47:55.890 --> 00:47:57.430
– This leaves Tiffany flustered.

00:47:57.430 --> 00:48:01.390
She argues that Nica holds a part of Chucky’s
soul as well, but he doesn’t care, since

00:48:01.390 --> 00:48:03.430
there are 72 other Chuckys on the truck.

00:48:03.430 --> 00:48:05.590
She reluctantly agrees, in tears.

00:48:05.590 --> 00:48:08.590
– [Chucky] Who is it you’re afraid of losing Tiff?

00:48:08.590 --> 00:48:10.930
Me or her?

00:48:10.930 --> 00:48:14.079
– When Tiffany doesn’t act, he orders
Junior to do it, but before he can muster

00:48:14.079 --> 00:48:17.740
the courage, Tiff retaliates by attacking
the doll and cutting his head off, which she

00:48:17.740 --> 00:48:20.750
picks up and delivers another dramatic breakup
speech to.

00:48:20.750 --> 00:48:24.109
Chucky threatens to kill her with one of his
many incarnations, but she boasts that he

00:48:24.109 --> 00:48:25.480
needs her too much.

00:48:25.480 --> 00:48:29.010
She brings out a suitcase, which she explains
to be a present from Glenda, the violent one

00:48:29.010 --> 00:48:30.010
of her two twins.

00:48:30.010 --> 00:48:34.873
The luggage is filled with bombs, which she
sets as a trap for Andy Barclay when he inevitably arrives.

00:48:34.873 --> 00:48:38.714
(explosion)

00:48:38.714 --> 00:48:43.280
Tiffany, Junior, and one of the 72 dolls that
Junior stole are loaded up in the car and

00:48:43.280 --> 00:48:46.600
don’t emerge again until the next day, when
the mayor introduces Jennifer Tilly at the

00:48:46.600 --> 00:48:47.869
benefit screening and auction.

00:48:47.869 --> 00:48:51.599
During the announcement, the mayor’s youngest
daughter, Caroline, throws a fit because she

00:48:51.599 --> 00:48:53.960
wants a Chucky doll, so Tiffany gives her
one extra.

00:48:53.960 --> 00:48:59.110
– I’m sure one measly little sick
child can take care of himself.

00:48:59.110 --> 00:49:00.250
Here sweetheart.

00:49:00.250 --> 00:49:03.680
Your very own good guy doll!

00:49:03.680 --> 00:49:07.319
– She doesn’t seem to stay for the screening,
which is odd because it’s the prequel to

00:49:07.319 --> 00:49:09.589
a movie she was so moved by: Bride of Frankenstein.

00:49:09.589 --> 00:49:13.230
I guess she’s got other things to do, like
meeting up with the driver and briefing him

00:49:13.230 --> 00:49:16.160
on when the plane leaves and how she’s going
to kill him if he’s late.

00:49:16.160 --> 00:49:20.334
With that she gets in her car and turns around
to see that Andy has hi-jacked the truck.

00:49:20.334 --> 00:49:23.539
– Nooooooo!!!!

00:49:23.569 --> 00:49:24.660
– Not all is lost though.

00:49:24.660 --> 00:49:29.000
She must have forgotten about her backup plan,
or maybe the tantrum was just part of a performance

00:49:29.000 --> 00:49:32.123
to get Andy to let his guard down before this
happens.

00:49:32.123 --> 00:49:33.703
(glass shatters)

00:49:34.410 --> 00:49:37.910
The doll version of Tiffany breaks the window
and introduces herself to Andy by holding

00:49:37.910 --> 00:49:41.621
him at gunpoint and ordering him to drive
to the airport, if he knows what’s good for him.

00:49:41.621 --> 00:49:45.349
Meanwhile, the human Tiffany goes back to
her favorite room at the Hotel Hackensack

00:49:45.349 --> 00:49:46.869
with Nica, who was incapacitated.

00:49:46.869 --> 00:49:51.670
It’s not clear how she snuck Nica’s unconscious
body upstairs without drawing suspicion, but

00:49:51.670 --> 00:49:55.660
given that she’s a disposal expert, it’s
not hard to imagine she’d also be good at

00:49:55.660 --> 00:49:57.250
smuggling live bodies.

00:49:57.250 --> 00:50:00.720
She also had less weight to carry, because
as a preventative measure, she decided to

00:50:00.720 --> 00:50:02.820
cut off all of Nica’s limbs.

00:50:02.820 --> 00:50:06.960
This way Chucky can’t go anywhere no matter
what, can’t kick her, and kill her, as he

00:50:06.960 --> 00:50:07.960
promised back at the basement.

00:50:08.503 --> 00:50:10.503
(impact)

00:50:13.353 --> 00:50:17.269
♪ rock music ♪

00:50:17.620 --> 00:50:21.369
As Tiffany holds Andy at gunpoint, three Good
Guy Dolls from Chucky’s army escape from

00:50:21.369 --> 00:50:23.920
their boxes and have their own conversation
in the back.

00:50:23.920 --> 00:50:27.703
It seems that they don’t recognize Andy
and Tiffany right away, which Andy points out.

00:50:27.703 --> 00:50:29.410
– They don’t know me.

00:50:29.410 --> 00:50:31.324
They don’t know you either.

00:50:31.324 --> 00:50:32.700
They don’t know
what you did.

00:50:32.700 --> 00:50:35.960
– This distracts Tiffany, so Andy is able
to swerve, making her drop her gun.

00:50:35.960 --> 00:50:40.160
He picks it up and blows her head off, and
that is the end of the Doll Tiffany introduced

00:50:40.160 --> 00:50:41.240
in Cult.

00:50:41.240 --> 00:50:43.929
That just leaves Tiffany living in Jennifer
Tilly’s body.

00:50:43.929 --> 00:50:47.450
She isolates herself and Nica in the Beverly
Hills house, and decorates Nica’s room to

00:50:47.450 --> 00:50:48.830
look like a doll’s room.

00:50:48.830 --> 00:50:52.470
Tiffany’s obsession with dolls is projected
onto Nica and she treats her like a doll,

00:50:52.470 --> 00:50:56.000
dressing her up, feeding her and mothering
her, despite Nica’s discomfort with this.

00:50:56.000 --> 00:51:00.000
In addition to all of Tiffany’s other problems
she becomes, essentially, agoraphobic.

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:04.349
According to the Mayo Clinic, “Agoraphobia
involves fearing and avoiding places or situations

00:51:04.349 --> 00:51:07.640
that might cause panic and feelings of being
trapped, helpless or embarrassed.”

00:51:07.640 --> 00:51:11.339
It’s often described as the fear of going
outside, which may be a result of the authorities

00:51:11.339 --> 00:51:13.240
closing in on Nica’s location.

00:51:13.240 --> 00:51:17.020
She uses a security system app, allowing her
to monitor all points of entry onto the property

00:51:17.020 --> 00:51:19.670
so she always knows who is coming and going.

00:51:19.670 --> 00:51:23.020
Tiffany spends most of her time making Nica
watch Jennifer Tilly movies with her, like

00:51:23.020 --> 00:51:24.579
when they watch Liar, Liar.

00:51:24.579 --> 00:51:27.910
She repeats all of Jennifer’s lines as if
it was her who played that part.

00:51:27.910 --> 00:51:32.150
She’s reveling in the past, just like the
character Norma Desmond from Sunset Blvd,

00:51:32.150 --> 00:51:34.930
only she is obsessed with Jennifer’s past,
not her own.

00:51:34.930 --> 00:51:38.980
Nica criticizes her for living this way and
points out that this lifestyle is not sustainable

00:51:38.980 --> 00:51:43.690
in the long run, claiming, “I know you went
through all of Jennifer Tilly’s Simpsons

00:51:43.690 --> 00:51:44.690
money.

00:51:44.690 --> 00:51:49.030
How does one person go through one hundred
million dollars?”

00:51:49.030 --> 00:51:52.420
Tiffany brushes this off saying, “It’s
not easy being me.

00:51:52.420 --> 00:51:55.140
It’s not cheap being me either.”

00:51:55.140 --> 00:51:59.369
However, her sense of safety is shattered
in November of 2022, when Tiffany wakes up

00:51:59.369 --> 00:52:02.160
to find the doll version of her head under
the covers with her.

00:52:02.160 --> 00:52:05.450
After feeding Nica breakfast, she pulls out
her nail file and cuts her own hand open,

00:52:05.450 --> 00:52:08.500
and the sight of blood forces Nica to relinquish
control to Chucky.

00:52:08.500 --> 00:52:12.150
Tiffany freaks out, and assumes Chucky is
responsible, to which Chucky responds that

00:52:12.150 --> 00:52:13.319
he’s “coming for her.”

00:52:13.319 --> 00:52:16.530
We still don’t really know how the doll
head got there, considering Nica-Chucky has

00:52:16.530 --> 00:52:20.970
no way of communicating with the others, and
the multiple Chuckys are not a hive mind situation.

00:52:20.970 --> 00:52:24.730
Perhaps if a new Chucky is created, he would
begin with all the information of past Chuckys,

00:52:24.730 --> 00:52:26.210
and thus, know Nica-Chucky’s location.

00:52:26.210 --> 00:52:30.030
However, we don’t know of any new Chuckys
being created between the movie theater incident

00:52:30.030 --> 00:52:31.730
and the doll head wake up call.

00:52:31.730 --> 00:52:34.319
Tiffany prepares for Glen and Glenda’s birthday
weekend.

00:52:34.319 --> 00:52:38.140
The twins were born in March, not November,
but… they were busy!

00:52:38.140 --> 00:52:39.260
They were in school!

00:52:39.260 --> 00:52:41.540
Look, the birthday is just in November now,
OK?

00:52:41.540 --> 00:52:45.450
To keep Nica quiet during the festivities,
Tiffany asks if she’d prefer the ball gag

00:52:45.450 --> 00:52:48.210
or chloroform, but their conversation is interrupted.

00:52:48.210 --> 00:52:51.570
Once again, her security system is breached
as a Detective rings the doorbell.

00:52:51.570 --> 00:52:55.370
Tiffany meets Detective Gavin, who is investigating
the missing person(s) case of Nica Pierce.

00:52:55.370 --> 00:52:59.369
Caught off guard, Tiffany tells him she knows
nothing and shuts the door on him, hoping

00:52:59.369 --> 00:53:00.369
he’ll go away.

00:53:00.369 --> 00:53:02.319
Which he does, but only temporarily.

00:53:02.319 --> 00:53:05.970
The next day, Tiffany is preparing the birthday
cakes for them, when she hears the gate chime,

00:53:05.970 --> 00:53:09.520
assumes it’s them, and allows access to
the house, but when she gets to the door,

00:53:09.520 --> 00:53:12.970
it’s Detective Gavin again, insisting that
he thinks Jennifer Tilly is likely hiding

00:53:12.970 --> 00:53:14.040
Nica Pierce.

00:53:14.040 --> 00:53:17.819
In a panic, Tiffany slits his throat and with
no time to properly dispose of him, she jams

00:53:17.819 --> 00:53:21.569
his body into a coat closet and tries to mop
up the blood with one of her sweaters, just

00:53:21.569 --> 00:53:23.160
as Glen and Glenda walk in.

00:53:23.160 --> 00:53:27.130
After so many years, and so much plotting,
she finds herself back in the familiar position

00:53:27.130 --> 00:53:29.869
of trying to hide her violent true nature
from her kids.

00:53:29.869 --> 00:53:33.590
They both seem shocked and surprised to see
blood, suggesting that maybe Glenda was too

00:53:33.590 --> 00:53:36.799
young to remember witnessing Tiffany kill
the nanny on her fifth birthday.

00:53:36.799 --> 00:53:40.609
Tiffany plays off the blood as just corn syrup,
explaining that violent content is what her

00:53:40.609 --> 00:53:41.609
fans want.

00:53:41.609 --> 00:53:43.569
This is enough to pacify Glen and Glenda.

00:53:43.569 --> 00:53:47.050
As a reminder, they think that their mom is
the actress Jennifer Tilly, and don’t really

00:53:47.050 --> 00:53:48.890
know who Tiffany Valentine is.

00:53:48.890 --> 00:53:52.280
As they talk, the twins reveal that they know
their Mom is having money trouble, which makes

00:53:52.280 --> 00:53:53.280
her defensive.

00:53:53.280 --> 00:53:57.650
As she tries to change the subject, Glen asks
who Nica Pierce is, again, catching her by

00:53:57.650 --> 00:54:00.359
surprise, as the twins are not supposed to
know anything about Nica.

00:54:00.359 --> 00:54:04.250
Tiffany wavers back and forth between claiming
that Nica is someone she barely knows to saying

00:54:04.250 --> 00:54:07.530
that she’s an obsessed stalker, which is
why she needs all of the security.

00:54:07.530 --> 00:54:11.089
In the midst of this, Glen gets up to look
for a cell phone charger, and Glenda uses

00:54:11.089 --> 00:54:14.560
the opportunity to ask if there’s anything
she’s hidden from them, because both of

00:54:14.560 --> 00:54:16.339
them keep having the same nightmare.

00:54:16.339 --> 00:54:20.460
Glenda describes this nightmare, which involved
lighting a woman on fire and a man addressing

00:54:20.460 --> 00:54:22.500
someone named Sh** Face.

00:54:22.500 --> 00:54:27.119
Tiffany, realizing that Glenda somehow remembers
killing Jennifer’s assistant in 2004, panics

00:54:27.119 --> 00:54:30.390
and blames it on Glen and Glenda’s very
active imaginations.

00:54:30.390 --> 00:54:34.109
To prevent them from finding the room Nica's
in, she hires a butler and even gives him

00:54:34.109 --> 00:54:35.470
a fancy name, Jeeves!

00:54:35.470 --> 00:54:36.470
Very original!

00:54:36.470 --> 00:54:40.710
We have no clue where Tiffany found this guy
or what his deal is, but she puts him in charge

00:54:40.710 --> 00:54:42.440
of guarding the door to Nica's room.

00:54:42.440 --> 00:54:45.790
While she's leading him to his post, she's
startled to find Glen trying to get into the

00:54:45.790 --> 00:54:46.860
same room!

00:54:46.860 --> 00:54:50.330
Tiffany quickly shuts this down and tries
to play it off as if it's no big deal, claiming

00:54:50.330 --> 00:54:52.010
that all of her shoes are in there!

00:54:52.010 --> 00:54:55.185
As Tiffany walks back to the living room,
she is met with another surprise.

00:54:55.185 --> 00:54:56.100
Literally.

00:54:56.100 --> 00:54:58.340
– SURPRISE!

00:54:58.340 --> 00:55:02.550
– Apparently, Glen and Glenda arranged their
own surprise party with Gina Gershon, Sutton

00:55:02.550 --> 00:55:04.460
Stracke and Joe Pantoliano.

00:55:04.460 --> 00:55:08.150
The whole situation turns into a huge intervention
of her friends wanting to know why Jennifer

00:55:08.150 --> 00:55:11.900
disappeared on them for the past year, but
things get worse for Tiffany when Jennifer’s

00:55:11.900 --> 00:55:13.119
sister, Meg Tilly arrives.

00:55:13.119 --> 00:55:17.830
While everyone else had been ghosted for only
one year, Meg had been ghosted for twenty.

00:55:17.830 --> 00:55:21.160
Tiffany does her best to brush the whole thing
off but Meg isn’t having it and pleads for

00:55:21.160 --> 00:55:22.160
answers.

00:55:22.160 --> 00:55:25.039
As Tiffany does a wardrobe change to look
more appropriate for a party, she puts on

00:55:25.039 --> 00:55:27.690
the dress that the real life Jennifer Tilly
wore to the Academy Awards.

00:55:27.690 --> 00:55:31.350
Little does Tiffany know, the whole party
was all a distraction so that Glen and Glenda

00:55:31.350 --> 00:55:32.869
could help Nica escape.

00:55:32.869 --> 00:55:36.849
Glenda slips some arsenic into Jeeves’ drink,
killing him, and leaving the door to Nica’s

00:55:36.849 --> 00:55:38.049
room unguarded.

00:55:38.049 --> 00:55:42.060
When Tiffany and the dinner guests discover
Jeeves’ body and the now empty bedroom,

00:55:42.060 --> 00:55:45.940
Tiff acts fast and convinces everyone that
this is a murder mystery dinner party, and

00:55:45.940 --> 00:55:47.640
that Jeeves is just acting.

00:55:47.640 --> 00:55:51.250
This works to her advantage, because she too
needs to find out who killed Jeeves so that

00:55:51.250 --> 00:55:53.880
she can use that person to find the missing
Nica.

00:55:53.880 --> 00:55:57.829
As everyone investigates, Tiffany has two
separate bedroom encounters, one with Gina

00:55:57.829 --> 00:56:01.820
Gershon and the other with Joe Pantoliano,
both of which serve to further distract her

00:56:01.820 --> 00:56:05.640
from Nica’s escape, until Chucky regains
control of Nica’s body, and sneaks up on

00:56:05.640 --> 00:56:09.543
her as she’s interrogating Meg, pulling a gun into her face.

00:56:09.543 --> 00:56:13.109
– Ya know, I’m almost gonna miss you Tiff.

00:56:13.109 --> 00:56:14.196
Almost!

00:56:14.197 --> 00:56:16.197
(impact)

00:56:18.989 --> 00:56:22.898
♪ dark soundscape ♪

00:56:22.898 --> 00:56:26.160
– I think it’s fair to say by this point,
Chucky and Tiffany went from being a toxic

00:56:26.160 --> 00:56:28.160
couple to being toxic exes.

00:56:28.160 --> 00:56:31.589
The initial attraction that kept drawing them
back to each other does seem to genuinely

00:56:31.589 --> 00:56:34.250
be gone, and now they are just trying to kill
each other.

00:56:34.250 --> 00:56:38.490
However, to Chucky’s surprise, the gun is
empty, giving Tiffany the chance to slap Nica

00:56:38.490 --> 00:56:43.069
in the face, which just like when Glen / Glenda
was a doll, forces Nica to switch back to

00:56:43.069 --> 00:56:44.069
her true self.

00:56:44.069 --> 00:56:47.790
As Nica awakens, she realizes this is her
last chance for escape and truly books it

00:56:47.790 --> 00:56:49.740
out there using the prosthetic arms.

00:56:49.740 --> 00:56:52.020
Glen and Glenda argue about leaving with Nica.

00:56:52.020 --> 00:56:55.849
Glen is appalled that Glenda almost allowed
their Mom to be killed and opts to stay with

00:56:55.849 --> 00:56:58.849
Tiffany, while Glenda takes off with Nica
to try to get the bottom of what’s really

00:56:58.849 --> 00:56:59.849
going on.

00:56:59.849 --> 00:57:03.539
Tiffany throws an absolute tantrum at the
thought of losing her beloved Nica, and tries

00:57:03.539 --> 00:57:07.020
to close the gate before she can get away,
but Nica and Glenda make it through just in

00:57:07.020 --> 00:57:11.500
time and are taken away by a very ADA compliant
van that’s waiting on the street.

00:57:11.500 --> 00:57:16.260
Tiffany is left behind in a mess, and on top
of everything that just transpired, Glen asks

00:57:16.260 --> 00:57:19.330
who Tiffany Valentine is, but their conversation
gets interrupted.

00:57:19.330 --> 00:57:23.730
Gina and Sutton go home, thinking that they
just attended a really believable murder mystery

00:57:23.730 --> 00:57:27.730
party, but Meg isn’t ready to give up and
stays overnight, confronting Tiffany the next

00:57:27.730 --> 00:57:30.120
morning, and demanding a connection with her
sister.

00:57:30.120 --> 00:57:33.760
When Tiffany asks when Meg plans on leaving,
she says she won’t leave until she gets

00:57:33.760 --> 00:57:34.760
some answers.

00:57:34.760 --> 00:57:37.480
Seeing that she’s backed into a trap, Tiffany
gets desperate.

00:57:37.480 --> 00:57:40.720
She leaves the room and goes into what looks
like a storage room in her house.

00:57:40.720 --> 00:57:43.010
She’s got a lot of secret rooms in this
house.

00:57:43.010 --> 00:57:46.819
She pulls the cover off of a cage where the
real Jennifer Tilly, who is living in Tiffany’s

00:57:46.819 --> 00:57:48.910
old doll form, is being held captive.

00:57:48.910 --> 00:57:52.320
It probably would have made sense for her
to just hide Nica in here during the party.

00:57:52.320 --> 00:57:54.760
You know, keep your prisoners all in one place.

00:57:54.760 --> 00:57:58.339
Tiffany ignores her pleas for chocolate and
tells her that her sister is upstairs and

00:57:58.339 --> 00:58:00.380
she needs to know who the Dean brothers are.

00:58:00.380 --> 00:58:04.599
Jennifer realizes this could be her last chance
to see her sister or possibly escape, so instead

00:58:04.599 --> 00:58:08.450
of telling about the Dean Brothers, she explains
the plot of the movie The Blues Brothers.

00:58:08.450 --> 00:58:12.490
When Tiffany recounts this to Meg, she realizes
this and becomes even more suspicious.

00:58:12.490 --> 00:58:16.380
Feeling embarrassed, she storms back to the
storage room, but this time she’s followed

00:58:16.380 --> 00:58:19.990
by Meg and Glen who discover who this little
prisoner is.

00:58:19.990 --> 00:58:23.710
Tiffany pulls out her classic nail file and
– gives everyone manicures.

00:58:23.710 --> 00:58:24.710
No.

00:58:24.710 --> 00:58:26.179
No that’s not what happens.

00:58:26.179 --> 00:58:28.280
She brutally kills Meg in front of her long
lost sister.

00:58:28.280 --> 00:58:30.730
That’s one way to put a damper on the family
reunion.

00:58:30.730 --> 00:58:35.019
Glen, who has always been sheltered from Tiffany’s
evil side, watches in horror.

00:58:35.019 --> 00:58:36.390
– Who are you?

00:58:36.390 --> 00:58:42.589
– My name is Tiffany Valentine and I’m
your Goddamn Mother!

00:58:42.589 --> 00:58:47.010
– As Tiffany sits down and explains everything
to Glen, she says she has one last birthday

00:58:47.010 --> 00:58:49.530
present: the original Glen / Glenda doll.

00:58:49.530 --> 00:58:52.170
They both vow that they need to go find Glenda.

00:58:52.170 --> 00:58:55.829
Tiffany was once heralded as the body disposal
expert, but I guess she figured that hiding

00:58:55.829 --> 00:58:59.020
the bodies sitting in her house wouldn’t
do much good, because police would probably

00:58:59.020 --> 00:59:02.540
know that Detective Gavin’s last whereabouts
were at her mansion.

00:59:02.540 --> 00:59:05.730
Jennifer Tilly was about to become a fugitive
no matter what.

00:59:05.730 --> 00:59:09.280
That being said, I still don’t get why she
sets the house on fire.

00:59:09.280 --> 00:59:13.700
It seems extremely unnecessary, but then again,
she’s not exactly a stable person.

00:59:13.700 --> 00:59:16.480
She drives off in her red Pontiac with Jennifer
and Glen.

00:59:16.480 --> 00:59:20.170
It doesn’t take long for word to hit the
news that the famous actress is a murderer,

00:59:20.170 --> 00:59:23.240
but that doesn’t stop her from being swarmed
by fans at roadside diner.

00:59:23.240 --> 00:59:27.340
I can’t tell if this is a dumb scene, or
some kind of scathing commentary on how people

00:59:27.340 --> 00:59:28.650
idolize celebrities too much.

00:59:28.650 --> 00:59:32.190
I don’t know why she didn’t just switch
back into the doll body at this point.

00:59:32.190 --> 00:59:35.550
The only thing I can figure is that she kind
of knows that once she returns to being a

00:59:35.550 --> 00:59:39.349
doll, Jennifer Tilly is going to be arrested,
so she’s savoring her final moments in a

00:59:39.349 --> 00:59:41.290
human body that resembles her own.

00:59:41.290 --> 00:59:44.970
She does plan to trade places with Jennifer
again, but Jennifer no longer wants her own

00:59:44.970 --> 00:59:49.039
body now that she’s wanted for murder, so
she escapes the car and makes a run for it,

00:59:49.039 --> 00:59:53.839
but her escape is cut short when she’s DESTROYED
by a semi truck, leaving Tiffany without a

00:59:53.839 --> 00:59:54.839
plan B.

00:59:54.839 --> 00:59:58.860
But first thing’s first, Tiffany and Glen’s
priority is getting back to Glenda, so they

00:59:58.860 --> 01:00:03.040
continue the cross country road trip back
to where it all began: New Jersey.

01:00:03.040 --> 01:00:06.480
Tiffany and Glen show up at the Catholic School
of the Incarnate Lord later that week and

01:00:06.480 --> 01:00:08.109
discover all that has happened.

01:00:08.109 --> 01:00:12.390
Chucky was separated from Nica’s body, and
Glenda informs Glen that their father is dead.

01:00:12.390 --> 01:00:15.450
However, as we know, Chucky always comes back.

01:00:15.450 --> 01:00:16.960
But we’ll get to that later.

01:00:16.960 --> 01:00:21.290
Tiffany, somehow more of an emotional wreck
than usual, tries to talk to Nica, but Nica

01:00:21.290 --> 01:00:24.800
pulls a gun on her, hungry for revenge for
everything Tiff has put her through.

01:00:24.800 --> 01:00:29.320
Glen, being the more sheltered, non-violent
twin, dives in front of Tiffany to save her

01:00:29.320 --> 01:00:30.410
and takes the bullet.

01:00:30.410 --> 01:00:34.619
Tiffany and Glenda rush to the hospital, but
due to Jennifer Tilly being wanted for murder,

01:00:34.619 --> 01:00:36.380
only Glenda can go inside.

01:00:36.380 --> 01:00:41.039
Glen goes into a coma and is not expected
to live much longer, so on December 22nd,

01:00:41.039 --> 01:00:45.589
2022, Tiffany devises a plan to sneak in and
transfer both twins back into the doll.

01:00:45.589 --> 01:00:48.220
I don’t really understand why Glenda can’t
just do it.

01:00:48.220 --> 01:00:51.560
I mean, Tiffany is just going off the Voodoo
for Dummies book anyway…

01:00:51.560 --> 01:00:55.329
But I’m not an expert on Voodoo, there’s
probably a very good reason that this particular

01:00:55.329 --> 01:00:58.359
soul transfer has to be performed by a 3rd
party.

01:00:58.359 --> 01:01:02.010
The plan is nearly foiled when a police officer
discovers them, but a quick-thinking Tiffany

01:01:02.010 --> 01:01:04.119
smashes him over the head with a vase.

01:01:04.119 --> 01:01:07.520
Shortly after, Glenda’s murderous side comes
out.

01:01:08.345 --> 01:01:11.865
(electricity flowing)
(man screams)

01:01:13.369 --> 01:01:17.589
This allows Tiffany to execute the Voodoo
ritual and leave with Glen slash Glenda packed

01:01:17.589 --> 01:01:22.079
safely in a suitcase, while the twins’ abandoned
human bodies lay in the hospital bed for this

01:01:22.079 --> 01:01:24.203
unfortunate nurse to find.

01:01:24.409 --> 01:01:28.810
(nurse screams)

01:01:28.810 --> 01:01:33.039
Fun fact: these are not dead bodies, they’re
just abandoned vessels.

01:01:33.039 --> 01:01:34.039
Which means I can show them!

01:01:34.039 --> 01:01:36.589
I’ve been waiting my whole career for something
like this to happen.

01:01:36.589 --> 01:01:40.369
Tiffany gives Glen slash Glenda a make over
and asks what she should call the unified

01:01:40.369 --> 01:01:41.510
child now.

01:01:41.510 --> 01:01:43.619
Everyone agrees that the name G/G would be
appropriate.

01:01:43.619 --> 01:01:47.319
You got one G for Glen, you got the other
G for Glenda, it’s perfect.

01:01:47.319 --> 01:01:51.090
Also G/G’s English accent comes back for
some reason, in addition to a sudden desire

01:01:51.090 --> 01:01:52.490
to go to England.

01:01:52.490 --> 01:01:55.650
Tiffany supports this, and offers a ride to
the post office, using the same method of

01:01:55.650 --> 01:01:58.640
travel that she’s used for Chucky many times
in the past.

01:01:58.640 --> 01:02:02.079
That just leaves the question of where she’ll
be depositing her own soul, and the answer

01:02:02.079 --> 01:02:06.300
comes when she sees Hackensack’s former
Mayor live streaming her Christmas decorating.

01:02:06.300 --> 01:02:09.529
We will just assume this is a burner phone,
because the police haven’t figured out her

01:02:09.529 --> 01:02:10.609
location yet.

01:02:10.609 --> 01:02:14.390
Mrs. Cross has a Wedding Belle doll, which
is exactly the type of doll that Tiffany needs

01:02:14.390 --> 01:02:16.349
to return to doll form.

01:02:16.349 --> 01:02:19.730
Realizing this is her one chance, she goes
to Michelle Cross’s house on Christmas Eve,

01:02:19.730 --> 01:02:22.930
but to her surprise, the doll is missing from
the Nativity scene in the front yard when

01:02:22.930 --> 01:02:24.130
she arrives.

01:02:24.130 --> 01:02:28.420
She sneaks into the house and is immediately
discovered by Mrs. Cross, who, instead of

01:02:28.420 --> 01:02:32.890
being alarmed by wanted killer Jennifer Tilly
being in her home, she is starstruck, and

01:02:32.890 --> 01:02:35.180
tries to use her for social media clout.

01:02:35.180 --> 01:02:36.740
This is cut short though when Chucky…

01:02:36.740 --> 01:02:40.760
I told you he’d be back… lunges out with
a chainsaw and slices Michelle in half.

01:02:40.760 --> 01:02:44.630
He’s about to go for Tiffany when Michelle’s
oldest daughter Lexy, drops down from the

01:02:44.630 --> 01:02:48.110
stairs and pins him to the ground, while she
revs up his chainsaw.

01:02:48.110 --> 01:02:51.460
Chucky pleads with Tiffany to help him, but
she demonstrates that she’s truly done with

01:02:51.460 --> 01:02:54.010
him and walks away to go find the Belle doll.

01:02:54.010 --> 01:02:57.870
She finds it in the younger sister Caroline’s
room, but quickly finds herself cornered by

01:02:57.870 --> 01:02:59.440
Jake, Devon and Lexy.

01:02:59.440 --> 01:03:03.710
However, just as the teenagers seem to have
her completely trapped, Caroline walks out

01:03:03.710 --> 01:03:07.849
and hands Tiffany a knife, before basically
giving herself up as a hostage and explaining

01:03:07.849 --> 01:03:10.140
that she’s been loyal to Chucky the whole
time.

01:03:10.140 --> 01:03:14.180
She’s been brainwashed into believing that
her real family is not actually her real family,

01:03:14.180 --> 01:03:16.450
and that Tiffany is actually her Mom.

01:03:16.450 --> 01:03:19.340
Caroline has been waiting for the day that
Tiffany would come for her.

01:03:19.340 --> 01:03:23.559
Tiffany, who loves an excuse to mother anything,
leaves with Caroline and flees to New York

01:03:23.559 --> 01:03:27.660
City, where she changes her look to this Uma
Thurman kind of haircut and survives incognito

01:03:27.660 --> 01:03:28.660
for a few weeks.

01:03:28.660 --> 01:03:33.630
She seems to think she’s in the clear, until
late January 2023, when she gets a call from

01:03:33.630 --> 01:03:34.630
Nica.

01:03:34.630 --> 01:03:38.580
Nica first apologizes for nearly killing Glen,
but makes it clear that she’s still close

01:03:38.580 --> 01:03:42.940
with G/G. Tiffany reacts to this in a way
that makes it seem likely that Nica probably

01:03:42.940 --> 01:03:45.460
talks to G/G more than she does.

01:03:45.460 --> 01:03:49.530
But before she can get too upset, Nica lets
her know that she knows where she is and is

01:03:49.530 --> 01:03:52.309
going to kill her but allows her to get a
headstart.

01:03:52.309 --> 01:03:56.660
Tiffany tries to do the Damballa ritual but,
like always, it doesn’t initially work.

01:03:56.837 --> 01:04:01.940
– POSSESS! Possess! Possess, possess you stupid doll!!

01:04:02.500 --> 01:04:06.359
– The doll does sit up but things don’t go
how Tiffany had planned.

01:04:06.359 --> 01:04:10.070
This is no Belle doll at all, but rather Chucky
in disguise.

01:04:10.070 --> 01:04:14.170
It becomes clear to Tiffany that Chucky and
Caroline have set her up.

01:04:14.170 --> 01:04:18.186
Chucky lunges at her with his knife while
Tiffany screams helplessly on the floor.

01:04:18.186 --> 01:04:21.277
That's the last we see of Tiffany Valentine... for now.

01:04:21.277 --> 01:04:25.170
At the end of the season, it seems like Tiffany
may have finally met her demise at the hands

01:04:25.170 --> 01:04:26.170
of Chucky.

01:04:26.170 --> 01:04:28.859
This is something he's been attempting to
do for a few years now, and it looks like

01:04:28.859 --> 01:04:30.589
he may have finally succeeded.

01:04:30.589 --> 01:04:34.600
However, there's also the possibility that
Tiffany's Damballa ritual may have delayed

01:04:34.600 --> 01:04:39.029
effects, as it has in the past, and she could
be transferred into Chucky - at the last minute.

01:04:39.029 --> 01:04:42.170
This could force the two to share a body,
and could create some really interesting dynamics

01:04:42.170 --> 01:04:43.170
in the future...

01:04:43.170 --> 01:04:44.430
we'll have to keep watching, to find out!

01:04:44.430 --> 01:04:47.539
So if you
want my updated analysis of Tiffany as new

01:04:47.539 --> 01:04:51.119
seasons or movies are released, and if you
want to see my character timeline analysis’

01:04:51.119 --> 01:04:55.069
of other Chucky franchise characters, make
sure you subscribe to CZsWorld for new horrors

01:04:55.069 --> 01:04:59.340
every week, ring the deathbell and select
all notifications and I will see you in the

01:04:59.340 --> 01:05:01.890
next one, assuming we both survive.

01:05:01.890 --> 01:05:03.890
♪ dance music ♪

